clude Double Cage Motor for Cement Mill, GD Series Brake Motor, Oil Well Pump Motor and Re-rolling Mill motor.</p>',1),(9,7,'Automation five','automation-five','motors-for-hazardous-area-lv_29121345.jpg','<p>We manufacture motors for special applications. Some of them include Double Cage Motor for Cement Mill, GD Series Brake Motor, Oil Well Pump Motor and Re-rolling Mill motor.</p>',1),(10,5,'Automation ten','automation-ten','special-application-motors_29034547.jpg','<p>We manufacture motors for special applications. Some of them include Double Cage Motor for Cement Mill, GD Series Brake Motor, Oil Well Pump Motor and Re-rolling Mill motor.</p>',1);
