INSERT INTO `mx_motor` VALUES (1,5,'sample motor1','sample-motor1','CG offers both Squirrel Cage (TPC & FTC Range) and Slip Ring (TPR & FTA Range) motors in horizontal (IMB3), vertical (IMV1) and inclined (IMB5, IMV5) mounting options to suit every customer requirement.','<p>Built in accordance with IEC 60034-1 / IS 325 standards, we offer customized, energy efficient and intelligent motors for various applications in IP23 & IP55 enclosures. We offer a wide range of cooling systems ranging from Self Circulation type (IC611) to independent forced circulation circuits (C616) and Tube Ventilated (IC511) to fin cooled (IC411) types.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nThe motors offered ranging from Open Air Circuit (IC01) and Closed Air Circuit (IC611) to independent externally fed air circuit (IC616). These are designed for optimum performance in adherence with application and site requirements of performance and space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nThese motors have been designed to meet diversified application demands, while maintaining excellent performance and the highest quality. The robust design helps function with variable voltage, variable frequency drives</p>','special-application-motors_29034547-1.jpg',0),(2,2,'High Voltage Motors','high-voltage-motors','CG offers both Squirrel Cage (TPC & FTC Range) and Slip Ring (TPR & FTA Range) motors in horizontal (IMB3), vertical (IMV1) and inclined (IMB5, IMV5) mounting options to suit every customer requirement.','<p>Built in accordance with IEC 60034-1 / IS 325 standards, we offer customized, energy efficient and intelligent motors for various applications in IP23 & IP55 enclosures. We offer a wide range of cooling systems ranging from Self Circulation type (IC611) to independent forced circulation circuits (C616) and Tube Ventilated (IC511) to fin cooled (IC411) types.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nThe motors offered ranging from Open Air Circuit (IC01) and Closed Air Circuit (IC611) to independent externally fed air circuit (IC616). These are designed for optimum performance in adherence with application and site requirements of performance and space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nThese motors have been designed to meet diversified application demands, while maintaining excellent performance and the highest quality. The robust design helps function with variable voltage, variable frequency drives.</p>','low-voltage-motors_09040708-2.jpg',0),(3,5,'Low Voltage Motors','low-voltage-motors',NULL,'<p>CG has an exemplary facility with an established manufacturing range of low voltage motors. All the manufacturing units are well supported by robust infrastructure. With world class infrastructure, we are satisfactorily meeting the client’s expectations. We have employed the most sophisticated and inclusive range of equipment and machinerys to carry out the bulk or customized order in most hassle-free and timely manner. Our core competencies lie in our manufacturing facility conforming to the international quality standards. In our continuous effort, to bring out the latest, most advanced product into market-place we continuously add many new services, features and introduce new innovative solutions so as to ensure complete customer satisfaction.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor better reliability of windings, we are using automated coil formation & Insertion machines. The   windings are impregnated in VPI Plant. All the motors manufactured undergo rigorous testing at a computerized test plant.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLow Voltage (LV) AC motors range cast iron and aluminium motors conforming to IEC and NEMA MG 1 Standards.</p>','low-voltage-motors_09040708.jpg',0),(4,6,'Energy Efficient Motors','energy-efficient-motors',NULL,'<p>Efficient use of energy enables commercial and industrial facilities to minimize production costs, increase profits, and stay competitive. The majority of electrical energy consumed in most industrial facilities is used to run electric motors. Energy-efficient motors now available are typically from 2 to 6 percent more efficient than their standard counterparts. This efficiency Improvement translates into substantial energy and money savings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>CG offers an entire range of energy efficient motors as per the latest IEC, IS & NEMA standards and also complies with the  efficiency norms of each geographies.</p>','low-voltage-motors_09040708-1.jpg',0),(5,4,'Motors for Hazardous Areas (HV)','motors-for-hazardous-areas-hv',NULL,'<p>CG is fully geared to manufacture and supply a complete range of hazardous low voltage motors designed to suit the ignitable atmospheres present in hazardous Locations such as Zone1, Zone 2 or Class1 Div 1 and 2. The motors are tested in nationally and internationally affiliated Laboratories and are approved by BASEEFA for ATEX, CSA for IEC and Ex Div 2 and DGMS / CCO for complete range of low voltage hazardous motors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We are the first manufacturers in India to develop motors complying with the requirements suitable for Group IIC (For Hydrogen Gas). With the advantage of meeting all the technical standards applicable for Oil and Gas industry, we cater efficiently to all the Oil companies  for their Off-Shore Platforms and Refineries projects.</p>','motors-for-hazardous-areas_18053121.jpg',0),(6,3,'Motors for Hazardous Area (LV)','motors-for-hazardous-area-lv',NULL,'<p>CG has the largest manufacturing range of low voltage motors suitable for hazardous area. These motors are designed to suit the ignitable atmospheres present in hazardous locations such as Zone1, Zone 2 or Class1 Div 1 and 2. Motors are suitable for various temperature classes & gas groups. CG manufactures Ex’e’ , Ex’nA’ & Ex’d’ enclosure motors. The motors are licensed by BASEEFA for ATEX, CSA for IEC and Ex Div 2 and DGMS / CCO for complete range of low voltage hazardous motors.</p>','motors-for-hazardous-areas_18053121-1.jpg',0),(7,7,'DC Motors','dc-motors',NULL,'<p>CG is an established name synonymous with rotating machines. Today, we are in a position to offer an ENTIRE RANGE of world Class DC Motors. We offer laminated Yoke DC Motors in IEC frame up to 710, for various applications for constant and variable speed requirements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nApplications:<br />\r\nPlastic extruders, Printing machines, Steel Rolling Mills, Wire Rod Mills, Apron Feeder, etc.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIndustries:<br />\r\nSugar, Textile, Rubber, Cement, etc</p>','motors-for-hazardous-areas_18053121-2.jpg',0),(8,8,'Special Application Motors','special-application-motors',NULL,'<p>We manufacture motors for special applications. Some of them include Double Cage Motor for Cement Mill, GD Series Brake Motor, Oil Well Pump Motor and Re-rolling Mill motor.</p>','special-application-motors_29034547.jpg',0),(9,8,'Energy Efficient Motors','energy-efficient-motors','sample motor1 subtitle','<p>Efficient use of energy enables commercial and industrial facilities to minimize production costs, increase profits, and stay competitive. The majority of electrical energy consumed in most industrial facilities is used to run electric motors. Energy-efficient motors now available are typically from 2 to 6 percent more efficient than their standard counterparts. This efficiency Improvement translates into substantial energy and money savings.<br />\r\n </p>','img4-min-1-1.jpg',0),(10,9,'Motors for Hazardous Area (LV)','motors-for-hazardous-area-lv',NULL,'<p>CG has the largest manufacturing range of low voltage motors suitable for hazardous area. These motors are designed to suit the ignitable atmospheres present in hazardous locations such as Zone1, Zone 2 or Class1 Div 1 and 2. Motors are suitable for various temperature classes & gas groups. CG manufactures Ex’e’ , Ex’nA’ & Ex’d’ enclosure motors. The motors are licensed by BASEEFA for ATEX, CSA for IEC and Ex Div 2 and DGMS / CCO for complete range of low voltage hazardous motors.</p>','mb-centrifugal-monoset-pump__530x530.webp',0),(11,7,'Laminated Yoke DC Motor','laminated-yoke-dc-motor',NULL,'<p>Laminated Yoke DC Motors are used mainly in Steel Industries, Lube oil Pump applications, Paper Mill, Printing Machines etc. </p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>CG offers Laminated Yoke DC Motors from Framesize 100 to 500.</p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>These DC Motors are available in various voltages such as 440 VDC, 220 VDC, 110 VDC and IP protection IP23 and IP55.  </p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>','dc_motor_24093013-2.jpg',0),(12,14,'Slip Ring Induction Motors','slip-ring-induction-motors',NULL,'<p>CG offers Low Voltage Slip Ring electric motors that range from **3.7 kW** to **350 kW** in both TEFC (IP55) and Drip Proof (IP23) construction. These motors are designed with a new Slip Ring and brush gear arrangement for trouble-free operations and long-lasting brush life. The Slip Ring is moulded in epoxy-based insulation and has excellent stability in operation at high temperature and very good anti-tracking property. CG also complies with IPSS standards to meet the requirements of Steel Plants.</p>','slip_ring_motors_lv_17044845.jpg',0),(13,17,'Motor third level testing','motor-third-level-testing','sample motor1 subtitle',NULL,'motors-for-hazardous-area-lv_29121345-1.jpg',0),(14,3,'bajaj motor','bajaj-motor',NULL,'<p>Bajaj FHP (Fractional Horsepower) motors are reliable single-phase and three-phase motors designed for household, commercial, and light industrial applications. These motors offer excellent performance with low power consumption.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings with robust construction, Bajaj motors are widely used in ceiling fans, water pumps, and small machine tools. All motors comply with Indian Standards and are manufactured with premium quality materials ensuring long operational life and reliability.</p>',NULL,0),(15,20,'Air Cooled Induction Motors','air-cooled-induction-motors-ic-6a1a1','IC 6A1A1, IC 6A1A6, IC 6A6A6 (CACA)','<p>CG Air Cooled Induction Motors (CACA) include TP and FT Series High Voltage motors with totally enclosed construction. The TPC range consists of foot mounted (IMB3) machines, which comply with both IS 2253 and IEC 60034-7.</p>\n\n<p>These motors feature totally enclosed IP55 protection as per IS 4691 / IEC 60034-5 and cooling with air to air heat exchangers comply with IEC 60034-6. Available in various power ratings and frame sizes suitable for industrial applications requiring reliable, efficient operation.</p>\n\n<p>All air cooled motors are designed for optimum performance in adherence with application and site requirements of performance and space. These motors have been designed to meet diversified application demands while maintaining excellent performance and the highest quality standards.</p>','HV-Air-Cooled-Induction-Motors.webp',1),(16,20,'Double Cage Motor for Cement Mill','double-cage-motor-cement-mill','Heavy Duty Cement Mill Application','<p>Double Cage Motor for Cement Mill applications from CG - a cost-effective alternative to the traditional slip ring motors for twin drives. These motors feature dual cage designs optimized for starting and running conditions.</p>\n\n<p>The double cage design provides excellent starting torque while maintaining full-load efficiency. These motors are particularly suitable for cement mill applications including raw mill, coal mill, and finish mill operations with various power ratings available.</p>\n\n<p>All double cage motors meet international standards and are tested for reliability in harsh industrial cement manufacturing environments. The specialized design ensures smooth acceleration and consistent performance under varying load conditions typical of cement mill operations.</p>','HV-Double-Cage-Cement-Mill.webp',1),(17,20,'Water Cooled Induction Motors','water-cooled-induction-motors-ic-8a1w7','IC 8A1W7 (CACW)','<p>Water Cooled Induction Motors (CACW) from CG include UW and FR Series High Voltage motors with advanced cooling technology. These motors feature water cooling systems designed for maximum thermal efficiency and reliable operation in continuous duty applications.</p>\n\n<p>The water cooling design allows for higher power density and superior thermal management compared to air-cooled alternatives. Available in various power ratings with IC 8A1W7 cooling configuration for industrial applications requiring efficient heat dissipation.</p>\n\n<p>All water cooled motors are engineered for optimum performance in demanding industrial environments. These motors are built to the highest quality standards conforming to international specifications and providing exceptional reliability and durability.</p>','HV-Water-Cooled-Motors.webp',1),(18,20,'Open Air Type Induction Motor','open-air-type-induction-motor','IC 0A1, IC 0A6 (SPDP)','<p>Open Air Type Induction Motor (SPDP) - Screen Protected Drip Proof motors from CG with IC 0A1 and IC 0A6 cooling configurations. These motors feature open construction with protective screens preventing direct liquid entry while allowing natural air circulation.</p>\n\n<p>The SPDP design provides cost-effective cooling solution for applications where completely sealed enclosures are not required. Available in various power ratings suitable for industrial machinery, fans, and equipment operating in relatively dry environments.</p>\n\n<p>All open air motors are designed for reliable performance with minimal maintenance requirements. These motors offer excellent cooling efficiency and are built to international standards ensuring superior performance and long operational life.</p>','HV-Open-Air-Motors.webp',1),(19,20,'Tube Ventilated Induction Motor','tube-ventilated-induction-motor','IC 5A1A1, IC 5A1A6 (TETV)','<p>Tube Ventilated Induction Motor (TETV) - CG manufactures totally enclosed tube ventilated motors (IC 5A1A1, IC 5A1A6) in both Squirrel Cage and Slip Ring designs that provide excellent performance in the most demanding environments and load conditions.</p>\n\n<p>The TV Series represents TETV motors most suitable for extreme dusty, humid and polluted atmospheres. TV Series Motors are used in industries such as Cement, Steel, Rubber, Paper, Refineries, Petrochemical and Fertilizer units as well as Power Generation plants.</p>\n\n<p>These motors feature tube ventilation systems that prevent dust and moisture ingress while maintaining effective cooling. All tube ventilated motors are built with robust construction and tested for reliability in harsh industrial environments.</p>','HV-Tube-Ventilated-Motors.webp',1),(20,20,'Fan Cooled Induction Motor','fan-cooled-induction-motor-tefc','IC 4A1A1, IC 4A1A6 (TEFC)','<p>Fan Cooled Induction Motor (TEFC) - CG NG-Series represents state-of-the-art, energy efficient and totally enclosed fan cooled (IC 4A1A1, IC 4A1A6) squirrel cage motors. These motors are extremely efficient, even at partial load and they have very low noise level.</p>\n\n<p>Efficiency of these motors is maximized by effective utilization of materials, minimizing losses and optimal design of the fins. Due to the reduced fan and core losses, there is no sharp drop in the efficiency curve at partial loads.</p>\n\n<p>All fan cooled motors feature advanced cooling systems and superior insulation for excellent thermal stability. These motors are ideal for continuous industrial applications requiring energy efficiency and quiet operation.</p>','HV-Fan-Cooled-Motors.webp',1),(21,20,'Energy Efficient Motors HV - N Series','energy-efficient-motors-hv-n-series','Premium Efficiency High Voltage','<p>Energy Efficient Motors HV - N Series from CG are trademarked series of industrial motors offered in air cooled and water cooled construction. These motors are designed keeping in mind the stringent noise, vibration regulations and efficiency requirements of the customer.</p>\n\n<p>Components are designed using finite elements of analysis, structural, thermal and air flow. This ensures better stress distribution and high structural rigidity to achieve higher power to weight ratio.</p>\n\n<p>These motors have been designed to meet varying application demands while maintaining high levels of quality and performance. The N-series range meets the requirements of various industrial sectors such as oil & gas, cement, sugar and power plants.</p>','HV-Energy-Efficient-N-Series.webp',1),(22,21,'AXELERA Process Performance Motors','axelera-process-performance-motors','High Performance LV Motors','<p>AXELERA Process Performance Motors are specially engineered for demanding industrial process applications requiring exceptional reliability and precision. These motors incorporate advanced control systems, superior thermal management, and robust construction for extreme operational conditions.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings with customizable configurations to match specific process requirements. AXELERA motors feature integrated monitoring and protection systems ensuring continuous safe operation. Ideal for critical industrial processes requiring maximum uptime, reliability, and process control capability.</p>','axelera-process-motors.webp',1),(23,21,'Flame Proof Motors Ex db (LV)','flame-proof-motors-ex-db-lv','Low Voltage Hazardous Area','<p>Flame Proof Motors Ex \'db\' (LV) - CG offers wide range of low-voltage flameproof squirrel cage induction motors. These motors are fully enclosed with flameproof construction preventing flames from escaping the motor enclosure.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings and frame sizes suitable for Zone 1 and Zone 2 hazardous areas. All flameproof motors are tested and certified for hazardous area compliance meeting international standards.</p>\n\n<p>The robust flameproof design ensures safe, reliable operation in explosive atmospheres. These motors feature excellent thermal protection and are manufactured to the highest quality standards for demanding industrial environments.</p>','flame-proof-motors-lv.webp',1),(24,21,'SMARTOR–CG Smart Motors','smartor-cg-smart-motors','CG Smart Motor','<p>SMARTOR–CG Smart Motors represent intelligent motor technology with integrated systems for advanced monitoring and control. These motors incorporate embedded sensors and communication capabilities for real-time performance monitoring.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Smart motors from CG provide predictive maintenance capabilities, efficiency optimization, and remote monitoring features. These advanced motors are designed for Industry 4.0 applications requiring intelligent, connected motor systems.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All SMARTOR motors feature robust construction with integrated electronics and advanced thermal management. These motors offer superior reliability for next-generation industrial applications.</p>','smartor-smart-motors.webp',1),(25,21,'Non Sparking Motor Ex nA / Ex ec (LV)','non-sparking-motor-ex-na-ec-lv','Non Sparking Low Voltage','<p>Non Sparking Motor Ex \'nA\' / Ex \'ec\' (LV) - State-of-the-art non-sparking motors from CG designed for hazardous areas with non-sparking construction (Ex n). These motors prevent sparking during normal operation through special air-gap geometry.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings suitable for Group II Categories 2G and 3G applications. All non-sparking motors are certified for ATEX compliance and suitable for explosive atmospheres in chemical plants and refineries.</p>\n\n<p>These motors feature advanced insulation systems and thermal protection. The specialized non-sparking design ensures safe operation in ignitable atmospheres with proven reliability in hazardous area applications.</p>','non-sparking-motor-lv.webp',1),(26,21,'Increased Safety Motors Ex eb (LV)','increased-safety-motors-ex-eb-lv','Enhanced Safety LV Motors','<p>Increased Safety Motors Ex \'eb\' (LV) - CG manufactures state-of-the-art increased safety motors with Ex \'e\' construction for hazardous area applications. These motors feature reinforced components preventing ignition sources in explosive atmospheres.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings suitable for Zone 1 and Zone 2 hazardous areas. All increased safety motors are ATEX certified and tested for reliability in demanding industrial environments.</p>\n\n<p>These motors incorporate advanced thermal protection and superior insulation systems. The robust increased safety design ensures reliable, safe operation in challenging hazardous area applications.</p>','increased-safety-motors-lv.webp',1),(27,21,'Cast Iron Enclosure Motors','cast-iron-enclosure-motors','Robust Industrial Motors','<p>Cast Iron Enclosure Motors - CG manufactures cast iron frame motors specifically for North American and industrial applications. These motors feature robust cast iron construction providing excellent mechanical strength and durability.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings and frame sizes suitable for diverse industrial applications. All cast iron motors meet NEMA standards and are designed for reliable performance in demanding industrial environments.</p>\n\n<p>The robust cast iron construction provides excellent thermal dissipation and mechanical protection. These motors are ideal for general industrial applications requiring durable, dependable motor performance.</p>','cast-iron-motors.webp',1),(28,21,'Aluminum Enclosure Motors','aluminum-enclosure-motors','Lightweight Efficient Motors','<p>Aluminum Enclosure Motors - NEMA aluminium motor range covers 0.50 Hp to 20 Hp with lightweight, durable aluminum construction. These motors provide excellent efficiency with reduced weight compared to cast iron alternatives.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various frame sizes and configurations suitable for commercial and light industrial applications. All aluminum motors meet NEMA MG-1 standards and are designed for reliable, efficient operation.</p>\n\n<p>The lightweight aluminum construction provides excellent thermal characteristics and corrosion resistance. These motors are ideal for applications where weight and space constraints are important considerations.</p>','aluminum-motors.webp',1),(29,21,'Slip Ring Motors (LV)','slip-ring-motors-lv','High Starting Torque Motors','<p>Slip Ring Motors (LV) - CG low-voltage slip ring motors from 3.7 kW to 350 kW in various frame sizes. These motors feature wound rotor design providing excellent starting torque and soft starting characteristics.</p>\n\n<p>Available with various rotor resistance options suitable for different starting requirements. All slip ring motors are designed for applications requiring high starting torque or frequent starting operations.</p>\n\n<p>These motors feature robust construction with advanced thermal protection. The slip ring design allows for external rotor resistance providing flexibility in speed and torque control for demanding industrial applications.</p>','slip-ring-motors-lv.webp',1),(30,22,'International Efficiency IE2 / IE3 - Apex Series','international-efficiency-ie2-ie3-apex','IE2 / IE3 High Efficiency','<p>International Efficiency IE2/IE3 - Apex Series - CG energy-efficient motors complying with international efficiency standards. These motors feature optimized magnetic circuit design and premium insulation materials for superior energy efficiency.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings meeting IE2 and IE3 efficiency levels. All Apex series motors are designed for energy-conscious applications where operational costs are critical.</p>\n\n<p>These motors incorporate advanced thermal management and superior cooling systems. The premium Apex series motors deliver long-term cost savings through reduced energy consumption while maintaining excellent performance.</p>','EE-IE3-Apex-Series.webp',1),(31,22,'Super Premium IE4 Efficiency - Apex Series','super-premium-ie4-efficiency-apex','IE4 Super Premium Efficiency','<p>Super Premium IE4 Efficiency – Apex Series - Next-generation green motor solution from CG with maximum energy efficiency. These motors feature advanced magnetic design and premium materials for IE4 super premium efficiency level.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings meeting the highest international efficiency standards. All IE4 motors are designed for maximum energy savings and environmental sustainability.</p>\n\n<p>These motors incorporate state-of-the-art cooling technology and advanced thermal protection. The premium IE4 Apex series motors deliver exceptional energy efficiency and long-term operational cost savings.</p>','EE-IE4-Apex-Series.webp',1),(32,22,'Totally Enclosed Fan Cooled Induction Motor - NG Series','totally-enclosed-fan-cooled-ng-series','NG Series TEFC Motors','<p>Totally Enclosed Fan Cooled Induction Motor - NG Series - CG state-of-the-art energy-efficient TEFC motors with advanced cooling systems. These motors feature optimized design for excellent partial load efficiency.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings suitable for continuous industrial applications. All NG series motors are designed for energy efficiency with minimal noise and vibration characteristics.</p>\n\n<p>These motors incorporate advanced fan cooling technology and superior thermal protection. The robust NG series design ensures reliable operation in demanding industrial environments with excellent efficiency performance.</p>','EE-NG-Series.webp',1),(35,24,'Large DC Machines','large-dc-machines','Industrial DC Motor Series','<p>CG is fully equipped to manufacture state-of-the-art LAMINATED YOKE DC Motors up to 2000 kW (50000 Nm torque) in frame size up to 710 in order to cover all the variable speed drive applications.</p>\n\n<p>The D.C. motor designs are with the latest technology developed and optimized with FEM/Flux plotting techniques to give maximum torque for each kg of material used. In-house critical facilities like shaft grinding on CNC, Commutator etc. are monitored and tested rigorously to ensure that each motor satisfies a rigid set of performance parameters.</p>\n\n<p>The high quality standards maintained in manufacturing and testing gives superior electrical and mechanical performance-making the motors most suitable for operating in tropical environment. Mandideep (Bhopal) plant is accredited with ISO 9001, ISO 14001 & OHSAS 18001.</p>','DC-Large-DC-Machines.webp',1),(36,24,'DC Motors','dc-motors-general','General Purpose DC Motors','<p>CG is an established name synonymous with rotating machines. Our manufacturing unit located at Ahmednagar (Maharashtra), India, manufactures DC motors up to 1500 kW.</p>\n\n<p>DC Motors from CG feature state-of-the-art LAMINATED YOKE DC Motors up to 2000 kW (50000 Nm torque) in frame sizes up to 710. The DC motor designs utilize the latest technology developed and optimized with FEM/Flux plotting techniques to give maximum torque for each kg of material used.</p>\n\n<p>In-house critical facilities like shaft grinding on CNC, Commutators etc. are monitored and tested rigorously to ensure superior electrical and mechanical performance. The high quality standards maintained in manufacturing and testing make these motors most suitable for operating in tropical environments. All plants are accredited with ISO 9001, ISO 14001 & OHSAS 18001.</p>','DC-DC-Motors.webp',1),(37,25,'Flame Proof Motors HV','flame-proof-motors-hv','High Voltage Hazardous Motors','<p>Flame Proof Large Motors Ex \'d\' (HV) - CG specializes in motors for hazardous areas with high-voltage flameproof construction. These motors prevent flames from escaping while maintaining full operational capability.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings suitable for Zone 1 and Zone 2 hazardous areas. All high-voltage flameproof motors are BASEEFA approved and tested for international compliance.</p>\n\n<p>These motors feature robust construction with advanced thermal protection. The specialized flameproof design ensures safe, reliable operation in the most demanding hazardous industrial environments.</p>','Flame-Proof-Motors-HV-Hazardous-Bombay.webp',1),(38,25,'Explosion Proof Motors HV','explosion-proof-motors-hv','ATEX Certified HV Motors','<p>Explosion Proof Motors HV - High-voltage motors with explosion-proof design for hazardous areas containing explosive gases and vapors. These motors feature reinforced construction preventing internal explosion propagation.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings suitable for demanding hazardous area applications. All explosion-proof motors are certified for international hazardous area standards.</p>\n\n<p>These motors incorporate advanced thermal protection and superior insulation systems. The robust explosion-proof design ensures safe operation in the most severe hazardous industrial environments.</p>','Flame-Proof-Motors-HV-Hazardous-Bombay.webp',1),(39,26,'Double Cage Motor for Cement Mill','double-cage-motor-cement-mill-app','Cement Industry Specialist','<p>CG manufactures Double Cage Motor for Cement Mill applications - a cost-effective alternative to the traditional slip ring motors for twin drives. These motors feature two cage designs optimized for starting and running conditions.</p>\n\n<p>The double cage design provides excellent starting torque while maintaining full-load efficiency. These motors are particularly suitable for cement mill applications including raw mill, coal mill, and finish mill operations. Available in various power ratings with robust construction designed for the demanding cement industry.</p>\n\n<p>All double cage motors meet international standards and are tested for reliability in harsh industrial environments. The specialized design ensures smooth acceleration and consistent performance under varying load conditions typical of cement mill operations.</p>','SA-Double-Cage-Cement-Mill.webp',1),(40,26,'Brake Motors','brake-motors','Integrated Brake Motors','<p>Brake Motors from CG are equipped with electromagnetic or spring-set brakes for holding loads on inclined planes, cranes, and hoists. These specialized motors provide safe, reliable holding capability on vertical applications.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings with different braking configurations. All brake motors are designed for applications requiring load holding and safety in vertical or inclined load scenarios.</p>\n\n<p>These motors feature robust construction with integrated braking systems. The specialized brake motor design ensures reliable load holding and safe operation in demanding lifting and hoisting applications.</p>','SA-Brake-Motors.webp',1),(41,26,'Oil Well Pump Motor','oil-well-pump-motor','Oil Industry Specialists','<p>Oil Well Pump Motor - Specialized motors designed for oil and gas applications including oil well pumping operations. These motors feature robust construction suitable for offshore platforms and refinery environments.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings with customized designs meeting API standards for oil and gas industry. All oil well motors are engineered for reliable operation in harsh petrochemical environments.</p>\n\n<p>These motors incorporate advanced thermal protection and corrosion-resistant materials. The specialized oil well design ensures reliable, safe operation in demanding offshore and refinery applications.</p>','SA-Oil-Well-Motor.webp',1),(42,26,'Re-Rolling Mill Motor','re-rolling-mill-motor','Steel Mill Specialists','<p>Re-Rolling Mill Motor - Specialized high-torque motors designed for metal rolling mill applications. These motors feature robust construction handling the demanding conditions of re-rolling mill operations.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings suitable for different rolling mill configurations. All re-rolling mill motors are engineered for heavy-duty continuous operation with excellent torque characteristics.</p>\n\n<p>These motors feature advanced thermal protection and reinforced mechanical construction. The specialized design ensures reliable operation under the demanding load conditions of metal rolling mill applications.</p>','SA-Re-Rolling-Mill-Motor.webp',1),(43,23,'Increased Safety Motors Ex \'e\' (LV)','increased-safety-motors-ex-e-lv','ATEX Certified Enhanced Safety LV Motors for Hazardous Zones','<p>Increased Safety Motors Ex \'e\' (LV) are specially engineered for hazardous areas with enhanced electrical and mechanical safety features. These motors incorporate reinforced insulation systems, temperature sensors, and advanced thermal protection suitable for Zone 1, Zone 2, and Class 1 Division 1 and 2 environments.</p>\n\n<p>The Ex \'e\' construction ensures increased safety through component design preventing ignition of surrounding hazardous atmospheres. Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 360 kW with voltages up to 650 V. All motors meet IEC 61800, IS and ATEX certification standards with superior reliability and performance.</p>','increased-safety-motors-ex-e-lv.webp',1),(44,23,'Non Sparking Motor Ex \'n\' (LV)','non-sparking-motor-ex-n-lv','Spark-Proof Low Voltage Motors for Hazardous Environments','<p>Non-sparking motors with Ex \'n\' certification for hazardous area applications. Features special air-gap geometry preventing sparking during normal motor operation. These motors are designed for safe operation in explosive atmospheres.</p>\n\n<p>Available in various power ratings suitable for Group II Categories 2G and 3G hazardous areas. All non-sparking motors are ATEX certified and tested for international hazardous area compliance standards.</p>\n\n<p>These motors incorporate advanced insulation systems and superior thermal protection. The non-sparking design ensures reliable, safe operation in challenging industrial hazardous environments.</p>','non-sparking-motor-ex-n-lv.webp',1),(45,25,'Increased Safety Motors Ex \'e\' (HV)','increased-safety-motors-ex-e-hv','ATEX Approved High Voltage Safety Motors for Industrial Hazardous Areas','<p>Increased Safety Motors Ex \'e\' (HV) are high-voltage motors designed with increased safety construction for hazardous area applications. These motors feature reinforced enclosures, enhanced insulation systems, and temperature monitoring suitable for Oil and Gas industry, petrochemical refineries, and mining operations.</p>\n\n<p>The Ex \'e\' (increased safety) design prevents ignition sources in Group IIC hazardous atmospheres. Available in power ratings from 0.75 kW to 2000 kW with voltages up to 11 kV. All motors are tested and certified by BASEEFA for ATEX compliance with excellent durability and operational reliability.</p>','increased-safety-hv-ex-e.webp',1),(46,25,'Non Sparking Motor Ex \'n\' (HV)','non-sparking-motor-ex-n-hv','High Voltage Non-Sparking Motors for Explosive Atmosphere Protection','<p>Non Sparking Motor Ex \'n\' (HV) features non-sparking construction suitable for Group IIC hazardous areas including hydrogen environments. The Ex \'n\' design incorporates special air-gap geometry and insulation systems preventing sparking during normal motor operation.</p>\n\n<p>These high-voltage motors are ideal for explosive atmospheres in chemical plants, refineries, and gas processing facilities. Available in power ratings from 0.75 kW to 2000 kW with voltages up to 11 kV. All motors meet international ATEX and IEC standards with proven reliability in the most demanding hazardous environments.</p>','non-sparking-hv-ex-n.webp',1),(47,25,'Pressurized Motor Ex \'p\' (HV)','pressurized-motor-ex-p-hv','Pressure-Enclosed High Voltage Motors for Classified Hazardous Zones','<p>Pressurized Motor Ex \'p\' (HV) is a type of equipment protection by pressurization (Ex p). The enclosure of the pressurizing apparatus is designed such that, when a flammable gas or vapor-air mixture enters, the average pressure inside is always higher than the surrounding atmosphere.</p>\n\n<p>These motors are suitable for hazardous areas Zone 1, Zone 2, and Class 1 Division 1 and 2 applications. The pressurized construction provides effective protection against ignition sources while maintaining high operational efficiency. Available in power ratings from 0.75 kW to 150 kW with voltages up to 11 kV.</p>','pressurized-motor-hv-ex-p.webp',1),(48,102,'Capacitor Start Motors','capacitor-start-motors','Reliable Single Phase Motors for Domestic Applications','<p>Capacitor Start Motors are single-phase motors incorporating a starting capacitor for high starting torque applications. These motors feature robust construction with excellent performance for intermittent-duty applications like air compressors, power tools, and industrial equipment requiring strong starting torque.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 5 kW with standard supply voltage 220-240V AC. All capacitor start motors include built-in thermal protection and are manufactured according to IS and IEC standards. The starting capacitor enables efficient startup with minimal mechanical stress.</p>','single-phase-motors-1.webp',1),(49,102,'Capacitor Run Motors','capacitor-run-motors','Energy Efficient Single Phase Motors with Continuous Duty Rating','<p>Capacitor Run Motors are single-phase motors with permanent capacitor connection for improved efficiency and smoother operation. These motors are ideal for continuous-duty applications like fans, blowers, and light machinery requiring energy-efficient performance.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 3 kW with standard supply voltage 220-240V AC. Capacitor run motors provide better power factor and lower operating costs compared to standard single-phase motors. All motors conform to IS and IEC standards with excellent thermal stability and long operational life.</p>','single-phase-motors-2.webp',1),(50,102,'Permanent Split Capacitor Motors','permanent-split-capacitor-motors','High Performance Single Phase Motors for Versatile Industrial Use','<p>Permanent Split Capacitor (PSC) Motors are single-phase motors with permanently connected capacitor for optimized efficiency in continuous operation. These motors are ideal for fan and blower applications where energy efficiency and reliability are critical requirements.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 2.2 kW with standard supply voltage 220-240V AC. PSC motors provide consistent performance with excellent power factor and minimal noise characteristics. All motors meet IS and IEC standards with superior thermal protection and dependable operation.</p>','single-phase-motors-3.webp',1),(51,102,'Split Phase Motors','split-phase-motors','Economical Single Phase Motors for Industrial Applications','<p>Split Phase Motors are single-phase induction motors with separate starting and running windings providing reliable starting torque for direct-on-line applications. These motors are widely used in household appliances, small machine tools, and commercial equipment.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 3.7 kW with standard supply voltage 220-240V AC. Split phase motors feature simple, rugged construction with low maintenance requirements. All motors comply with IS and IEC standards ensuring reliable performance in residential and commercial applications.</p>','single-phase-motors-4.webp',1),(52,103,'3 Phase Rolled Steel Body Motors - Standard Duty','3phase-rolled-steel-standard-duty','Versatile 3 Phase Motors for General Industrial Applications','<p>3 Phase Rolled Steel Body Motors - Standard Duty are affordable, reliable motors suitable for general industrial applications. These motors feature robust rolled steel frame construction with excellent mechanical durability and consistent performance across diverse load conditions.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.5 kW to 50 kW with standard 415V AC 3-phase supply and frame sizes 56 to 180. These motors meet IS 4691 and IEC 60034-5 standards with excellent thermal stability. Ideal for pumps, fans, conveyors, and general machinery requiring cost-effective, dependable motor performance.</p>','3phase-rolled-steel-1.webp',1),(53,103,'3 Phase Rolled Steel Body Motors - Heavy Duty','3phase-rolled-steel-heavy-duty','Heavy Duty 3 Phase Motors for Severe Industrial Conditions','<p>3 Phase Rolled Steel Body Motors - Heavy Duty are engineered for demanding industrial applications with high mechanical stress and continuous operation. These motors feature reinforced frame construction, superior insulation systems, and advanced thermal protection.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.75 kW to 75 kW with frame sizes 63 to 200 suitable for heavy-duty machinery. All heavy-duty motors meet IS 4691 and IEC 60034-5 standards with exceptional durability. Perfect for cement mills, crushers, compressors, and other demanding industrial equipment requiring maximum reliability.</p>','3phase-rolled-steel-2.webp',1),(54,103,'3 Phase Rolled Steel Body Motors - Premium Efficiency','3phase-rolled-steel-premium-efficiency','Energy Efficient 3 Phase Motors with Advanced Steel Construction','<p>3 Phase Rolled Steel Body Motors - Premium Efficiency delivers superior energy efficiency with reduced operating costs. These motors incorporate optimized magnetic circuit design, premium insulation materials, and advanced thermal management systems.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.5 kW to 50 kW with frame sizes 56 to 180 suitable for continuous industrial applications. All premium efficiency motors meet IS 12954 and IEC 60034-30 efficiency standards. Delivering long-term cost savings through reduced energy consumption, these motors are ideal for energy-conscious industrial facilities.</p>','3phase-rolled-steel-3.webp',1),(55,103,'3 Phase Rolled Steel Body Motors - Explosion Proof','3phase-rolled-steel-explosion-proof','Safety Certified 3 Phase Motors for Hazardous Industrial Areas','<p>Explosion-proof 3 phase motors with rolled steel construction for safe operation in hazardous areas. These motors feature reinforced enclosures designed to contain internal explosions.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.5 kW to 75 kW with frame sizes 56 to 200 suitable for hazardous area applications. All explosion-proof motors meet international safety standards and are ATEX certified.</p>\n\n<p>These motors feature robust rolled steel construction with advanced thermal protection. The specialized explosion-proof design ensures safe, reliable operation in the most demanding hazardous industrial environments.</p>','3phase-rolled-steel-4.webp',1),(56,104,'Huller Motors','huller-motors','Specialized Motors for Rice and Grain Processing Equipment','<p>Huller Motors are specialized 3-phase motors designed specifically for rice milling and grain processing equipment. These motors are engineered to handle the continuous load demands of huller machines with robust construction and high torque characteristics.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 2.2 kW to 7.5 kW with frame sizes 90 to 112. These motors feature reinforced shafts and superior mechanical protection suitable for dusty milling environments. All huller motors comply with IS 4691 and IEC 60034-5 standards.</p>','application-specific-2.webp',1),(57,104,'Cooler Motors','cooler-motors','High Performance Motors for Industrial Cooling Systems','<p>Cooler Motors are specially designed for air cooler and refrigeration applications with enhanced thermal management. These 3-phase motors feature robust cooling fins and superior heat dissipation for continuous operation in cooling equipment.</p>\n\n<p>Manufactured to withstand demanding operational conditions in air cooling systems, these motors provide reliable performance with power ratings from 1.1 kW to 37 kW. All cooler motors meet IS 4691 and IEC 60034-5 standards with excellent durability and minimal maintenance requirements.</p>','application-specific-3.webp',1),(58,104,'Flange Motors','flange-motors','Compact Flange Mounted Motors for Direct Drive Applications','<p>Flange Mounted Motors are 3-phase motors with integral flange coupling for direct connection to driven equipment like pumps, blowers, and compressors. These motors eliminate the need for separate couplings, reducing installation space and complexity.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.5 kW to 30 kW with frame sizes 56 to 160, flange motors are ideal for industrial applications requiring compact design and efficient power transmission. All flange motors meet IS 4691 and IEC 60034-5 standards with superior mechanical strength.</p>','application-specific-4.webp',1),(59,104,'Textile Industry Motors','textile-industry-motors','Specialized Motors for High-Speed Textile Machinery','<p>Textile Industry Motors are specialized 3-phase motors engineered for spinning mills, weaving looms, and other textile machinery. These motors feature precise speed control and low vibration characteristics essential for textile operations.</p>\n\n<p>With power ratings from 1.1 kW to 50 kW and frame sizes 90 to 180, textile motors are designed to withstand the demanding conditions of textile mills including exposure to lint and dust. All motors comply with IS 4691 and IEC 60034-5 standards with excellent thermal stability and long operational life.</p>','application-specific-1.webp',1),(60,104,'Agricultural Equipment Motors','agricultural-equipment-motors','Robust Motors for Farm Machinery and Equipment','<p>Agricultural Equipment Motors are 3-phase motors designed for agricultural machinery including pumps, threshers, and grain grinding equipment. These motors are engineered for reliable operation in farm environments with varying load conditions.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.75 kW to 10 kW, agricultural motors feature robust construction with excellent mechanical protection against dust and moisture. All motors meet IS 4691 and IEC 60034-5 standards and are manufactured to withstand the demanding operational requirements of agricultural applications.</p>','application-specific-5.webp',1),(61,106,'Emotron FDU - AC Drives','emotron-fdu-ac-drives','Reliable Field-Mount AC Variable Frequency Drives','<p>Emotron FDU - AC Drives are advanced variable frequency drives designed for controlled speed management of AC motors. These modular drives provide smooth acceleration, energy savings, and precise motor control suitable for pumps, fans, compressors, and industrial machinery.</p>\n\n<p>The FDU series features intelligent ramp functions, automatic restart capabilities, and multiple control modes with power ratings from 0.37 kW to 315 kW. These drives deliver efficient motor speed control with minimal electrical losses and superior performance in energy-critical applications.</p>','emotron-fdu-ac-drives.webp',1),(62,106,'Emotron VFX - AC Drives','emotron-vfx-ac-drives','Advanced AC Variable Frequency Drives for Industrial Control','<p>Emotron VFX - AC Drives are high-performance variable frequency drives featuring advanced motor control technology for precise speed regulation and torque management. These drives are particularly effective for pump, fan, and compressor applications where energy savings and smooth operation are critical.</p>\n\n<p>Available from 0.37 kW to 250 kW in compact to standard frame configurations. VFX drives incorporate modern power electronics with user-friendly programming interfaces. These drives deliver superior performance and reliable operation with minimal maintenance requirements.</p>','emotron-vfx-ac-drives.webp',1),(63,106,'Emotron AFE - Active Front End Drives','emotron-afe-active-front-end-drives','Energy Efficient Drives with Power Factor Correction','<p>Emotron AFE - Active Front End Drives are regenerative variable frequency drives capable of returning energy to the power grid during braking. These advanced four-quadrant drives are ideal for applications with frequent braking like cranes, hoists, lifts, and energy recovery systems.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 1.1 kW to 1000 kW with industrial-grade construction. AFE drives provide maximum energy efficiency through energy recovery while maintaining precise motor control. Perfect for demanding applications requiring both smooth operation and energy optimization.</p>','emotron-afe-drives.webp',1),(64,106,'Emotron CDU / CDX - Motor-Mounted Drives','emotron-cdu-cdx-motor-mounted-drives','Compact Motor-Mounted Variable Frequency Drive Solutions','<p>Emotron CDU / CDX - Motor-Mounted Drives are compact variable frequency drives designed to mount directly on motor terminal boxes. This integral configuration eliminates separate drive installations, reducing cabling complexity and space requirements.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 15 kW with motor-mounted design. These drives offer full variable frequency drive functionality in a compact, integrated package. Ideal for space-constrained applications requiring simplified installation and efficient motor control.</p>','emotron-cdu-cdx-drives.webp',1),(65,106,'Emotron DSV / GSV - Lift Drives','emotron-dsv-gsv-lift-drives','Specialized Drives for Elevator and Lift Systems','<p>Emotron DSV / GSV - Lift Drives are specialized variable frequency drives engineered for lift, hoist, and elevator applications. These drives incorporate advanced safety functions, smooth acceleration/deceleration, and emergency lowering capabilities meeting stringent safety requirements.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 200 kW with load monitoring and load-sensitive control features. DSV / GSV drives provide superior safety and reliability for vertical lifting systems. Ideal for elevators, construction hoists, and industrial lifting equipment.</p>','emotron-dsv-gsv-drives.webp',1),(66,106,'Emotron FlowDrive','emotron-flowdrive','Centrifugal Pump Optimization Drive Solution','<p>Emotron FlowDrive is a specialized variable frequency drive designed for pump applications with automatic flow control. FlowDrive continuously adjusts motor speed to match system flow requirements, eliminating throttling losses and reducing unnecessary pressure drops.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 315 kW. FlowDrive delivers exceptional energy savings for pumping systems by optimizing motor speed during partial load conditions. Perfect for water supply systems, irrigation, and industrial fluid handling applications.</p>','emotron-flowdrive.webp',1),(67,106,'Emotron VS10 & VS30 Drives','emotron-vs10-vs30-drives','General Purpose Industrial AC Variable Frequency Drives','<p>Emotron VS10 & VS30 Drives are premium variable frequency drives offering advanced motor control with multi-motor capability. These drives feature sophisticated control algorithms, programmable logic functions, and extensive application software.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 400 kW in compact to NEMA frame configurations. VS10 and VS30 series delivers superior performance and flexibility for complex industrial applications requiring advanced automation capabilities and multiple motor coordination.</p>','emotron-vs10-vs30-drives.webp',1),(68,106,'Emotron VSS Drives','emotron-vss-drives','Compact Single-Phase AC Drive Technology','<p>Emotron VSS Drives are robust variable frequency drives designed for demanding industrial environments. These drives feature compact design with enhanced cooling systems for operation in high-temperature areas with advanced diagnostics and protection functions.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 315 kW. VSS drives are suitable for industrial machinery, heavy-duty pump applications, and harsh operational environments. These drives deliver superior reliability and durability with minimal downtime requirements.</p>','emotron-vss-drives.webp',1),(69,106,'Emotron VSX Drives','emotron-vsx-drives','Advanced Three-Phase Industrial Drive Solutions','<p>Emotron VSX Drives are high-specification variable frequency drives featuring advanced power electronics and control technology. These drives offer excellent efficiency, precise motor speed control, and harmonic filtering technology for superior power quality.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 250 kW in compact frame configurations. VSX drives are ideal for precision machinery, sensitive process control, and applications requiring superior electrical compatibility and minimal electromagnetic interference.</p>','emotron-vsx-drives.webp',1),(70,106,'Emotron VSM Drives','emotron-vsm-drives','Modular Drive Architecture for Scalable Control','<p>Emotron VSM Drives are medium-power variable frequency drives designed for general industrial motor applications. These drives offer reliable motor speed control with energy-saving capabilities suitable for pumps, fans, machinery, and industrial applications.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 160 kW in compact frame configurations. VSM drives combine reliability, user-friendly programming, and compact design. These drives provide consistent performance with minimal maintenance for straightforward industrial applications.</p>','emotron-vsm-drives.webp',1),(71,106,'Emotron VSR Solar Drive','emotron-vsr-solar-drive','Renewable Energy Variable Frequency Drive Solutions','<p>Emotron VSR Solar Drive is a specialized variable frequency drive designed for solar-powered pump systems. This drive optimizes pump operation for variable solar power input with automatic adaptation to changing solar availability.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 100 kW with maximum power point tracking and smooth power transition capabilities. VSR Solar Drive delivers efficient, reliable pump operation powered by renewable solar energy. Perfect for remote water supply systems and off-grid pumping applications.</p>','emotron-vsr-solar-drive.webp',1),(72,106,'DC Drive','dc-industrial-drive','Direct Current Drive Systems for Industrial Applications','<p>DC Drive is a variable speed drive for controlling direct current motors in industrial applications. DC drives provide smooth acceleration, precise speed control, and efficient power management for DC motor systems.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 1000 kW with industrial-grade construction. DC drives deliver superior performance with excellent controllability and reliability for applications requiring variable speed, high starting torque, and precise regulation such as cranes, hoists, and industrial machinery.</p>','dc-drive.webp',1),(73,106,'MV Drives - Medium Voltage','mv-medium-voltage-drives','Medium Voltage Drive Technology for Large Industrial Motors','<p>MV Drives - Medium Voltage variable frequency drives are engineered for medium voltage motor applications (1 kV to 6.6 kV). These drives feature advanced power electronics technology for industrial applications requiring high-power motor control.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 37 kW to 10,000 kW for industrial-scale applications. Medium voltage drives are suitable for large motors in power plants, petrochemical facilities, mining operations, and heavy industrial applications. These drives deliver efficient motor control with superior power quality.</p>','mv-drives.webp',1),(74,107,'Emotron MSF 2.0 Softstarter','emotron-msf-2-0-softstarter','Modern Soft Starter for Smooth Motor Acceleration','<p>Emotron MSF 2.0 Softstarter is an intelligent soft-starting device designed to reduce mechanical and electrical stress during motor startup. This advanced starter provides smooth acceleration of AC motors while reducing inrush current and mechanical shock.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 5.5 kW to 280 kW with energy-saving operation by adjusting motor speed to match load requirements. MSF 2.0 softstarters are ideal for pump, fan, and conveyor applications. These starters deliver reliable motor starting with extended equipment life and reduced maintenance.</p>','emotron-msf-softstarter.webp',1),(75,107,'Emotron TSA Softstarter','emotron-tsa-softstarter','Compact Soft Starter for General Industrial Use','<p>Emotron TSA Softstarter is a compact soft-starting device for controlling AC motor startup and speed. This intelligent softstarter reduces mechanical stress and electrical inrush current while enabling smooth acceleration of motor systems.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 1.1 kW to 160 kW with advanced control features for optimized motor startup. TSA softstarters are suitable for centrifugal pumps, fans, conveyor systems, and general industrial machinery. These starters provide reliable, smooth motor starting with minimal mechanical stress.</p>','emotron-tsa-softstarter.webp',1),(76,107,'Variable Frequency Starter (VFS)','variable-frequency-starter-vfs','Frequency-Based Motor Control Soft Starter Technology','<p>Variable Frequency Starter (VFS) is an advanced motor control device combining soft-starting and variable frequency capabilities. This integrated solution provides smooth motor startup with energy-efficient speed control for diverse industrial applications.</p>\n\n<p>Available in power ratings from 0.37 kW to 315 kW with integrated functionality. VFS technology offers reduced inrush current, smooth acceleration, and optimized speed control in a single package. Ideal for pump systems, fan applications, compressors, and machinery requiring both controlled startup and energy efficiency.</p>','variable-frequency-starter.webp',1),(77,1,'High Low Voltage AC DC Motors','-igh-ow-oltage-otors',NULL,'The range of High and Low voltage AC &amp; DC motors include safe and hazardous area motors, energy efficient motors as well as motors for special ap',NULL,0),(78,1,'International Efficiency IE2 IE3 Apex series','-nternational-fficiency-2-3-pex-series',NULL,'The increasing costs of energy calls for saving the same in all steps of manufacture. Electric Motor Driven systems used in the industrial processes',NULL,0),(79,1,'Super Premium IE4 Efficiency Apex Series','-uper-remium-4-fficiency-pex-eries',NULL,'Out of our commitment towards high energy efficiency and top notch performance, CG presents the next and latest generation of a green solution, Apex',NULL,0),(80,1,'Totally Enclosed Fan Cooled Induction Motor NG Series','-otally-nclosed-an-ooled-nduction-otor-eries',NULL,'CG manufactures NG-Series Motors, which are the state - of - the art, energy efficient and Totally Enclosed Fan Cooled (TEFC) Squirrel Cage motors. T',NULL,0),(81,1,'Air Cooled Induction Motors IC 6A1A1 IC 6A1A6 IC 6A6A6 CACA','-ir-ooled-nduction-otors-6-1-1-6-1-6-6-6-6-',NULL,'CG offers CACA Motors, which include TP and FT Series High Voltage Induction Motors.',NULL,0),(82,1,'Energy Efficient Motors HV N Series','-nergy-fficient-otors-eries',NULL,'N-Series motors are the trademarked series of CG Industrial System. The motors are offered in air cooled and water cooled construction. These motors',NULL,0),(83,1,'Fan Cooled Induction Motor IC 4A1A1 IC 4A1A6 TEFC','-an-ooled-nduction-otor-4-1-1-4-1-6-',NULL,'CG manufactures NG-Series Motors, which belong to a family of state of the art, energy efficient and Totally Enclosed Fan Cooled (TEFC) Squirrel Cage',NULL,0),(84,1,'Open Air Type Induction Motor IC 0A1 IC 0A6 SPDP','-pen-ir-ype-nduction-otor-0-1-0-6-',NULL,'CG offers SPDP Motors which include UD and FH Series High Voltage Induction Motors.',NULL,0),(85,1,'Tube Ventilated Induction Motor IC 5A1A1 IC 5A1A6 TETV','-ube-entilated-nduction-otor-5-1-1-5-1-6-',NULL,'CG manufactures Totally Enclosed Tube Ventilated (TETV) Motors in Squirrel Cage (SCR) and Slip Ring (SR) designs that provide excellent performance i',NULL,0),(86,1,'Water Cooled Induction Motors IC 8A1W7 CACW','-ater-ooled-nduction-otors-8-1-7-',NULL,'CG offers CACW Motors which include UW and FR Series High Voltage Induction Motors.',NULL,0),(87,1,'Aluminium enclosure motors Safe area','-luminium-enclosure-motors-afe-area',NULL,'GD Series aluminum motor range covers product with output as little as 0.18kw to 11kw in frame sizes IEC63 to 160, GD series have Multi mount facilit',NULL,0),(88,1,'Cast Iron enclosure motors Safe Area','-ast-ron-enclosure-motors-afe-rea',NULL,'CG LV cast iron motor range covers products with outputs from 0.37 kW to 710 kW in frame sizes 63 to 500. They are suitable for use within a diverse',NULL,0),(89,1,'Flame Proof Motors Ex db LV','-lame-roof-otors-x-db-',NULL,'CG offers wide range of low voltage Flameproof squirrel cage &amp; Slip ring electric motors for operation in hazardous and hostile environments, ran',NULL,0),(90,1,'Increased Safety Motors Ex eb LV','-ncreased-afety-otors-x-eb-',NULL,'CG manufactures state-of-the-art INCREASED SAFETY MOTORS (Ex&rsquo;eb&rsquo;). These motors meet the stringent quality and performance norms laid dow',NULL,0),(91,1,'Non Sparking Motor Ex nA Ex ec LV','-on-parking-otor-x-n-x-ec-',NULL,'CG manufactures state of the art NON-SPARKING Motors Ex `nA`/ &lsquo;ec&rsquo;. These motors meet the stringent quality and performance norms laid do',NULL,0),(92,1,'Slip Ring Motors LV','-lip-ing-otors-',NULL,'CG has Low Voltage Slip Ring electric motors ranging from 3.7 kW to 350 kW in both TEFC (IP55) &amp; Drip Proof (IP23) construction. These motors are',NULL,0),(93,1,'SMARTORCG Smart Motors','-mart-otors',NULL,'Motors play a critical role in functioning of a manufacturing plant. These motors need to be serviced, maintained and analysed to avoid untimely brea',NULL,0),(94,1,'Flame Proof Motors Ex d LV','-lame-roof-otors-x-d-',NULL,'CG offers wide range of low voltage Flameproof Squirrel Cage &amp; Slip Ring electric motors for operation in hazardous and hostile environments, ran',NULL,0),(95,1,'Increased Safety Motors Ex e LV','-ncreased-afety-otors-x-e-',NULL,'CG manufactures state - of - the - art INCREASED SAFETY MOTORS. These motors meet the stringent quality and performance norms laid down by both India',NULL,0),(96,1,'Non Sparking Motor Ex n LV','-on-parking-otor-x-n-',NULL,'CG manufactures state of the art NON-SPARKING Motors Ex `n`. These motors meet the stringent quality and performance norms laid down by both Indian a',NULL,0),(97,1,'Flame Proof Large Motors Ex d HV','-lame-roof-arge-otors-x-d-',NULL,'One of the special areas of focus for CG has been motors for hazardous area applications. The scenario of operation of these motors and the regulator',NULL,0),(98,1,'Increased Safety Motors Ex e HV','-ncreased-afety-otors-x-e-',NULL,'CG manufactures state-of-the-art INCREASED SAFETY MOTORS. These motors meet the stringent quality and performance norms laid down by both Indian and',NULL,0),(99,1,'Non Sparking Motor Ex n HV','-on-parking-otor-x-n-',NULL,'CG manufactures state of the art NON-SPARKING Motors Ex `n`. These motors meet the stringent quality and performance norms laid down by both Indian a',NULL,0),(100,1,'Pressurized Motor Ex p HV','-ressurized-otor-x-p-',NULL,'Ex &lsquo;p&rsquo; motor is an economical solution for Large rating Flameproof motors (FLP motors) which can be used in Zone-1 of Hazardous Area. Wit',NULL,0),(101,1,'Re Rolling Mill Motor','-e-olling-ill-otor',NULL,'With versatile experience over the years, CG has developed a highly standardized range of motors dedicated specifically to the Re-rolling mill indust',NULL,0),(102,23,'Increased Safety Motors Ex ec (LV)','increased-safety-motors-ex-ec-lv','Zone 2 / IIC Group Hazardous Area Motors','<p>Increased Safety Motors Ex ec are purpose-built for Zone 2 hazardous area installations where the risk of an explosive atmosphere being present during normal operation is low. Designed and certified to IEC 60079-7 standards, these motors prevent the formation of dangerous arcs, sparks, or excessive temperatures on internal and external surfaces during normal running conditions.</p>\n<p>At Bombay Engineering Syndicate, we supply Crompton-make Ex ec motors trusted by oil refineries, petrochemical plants, gas processing facilities, paint and coating manufacturers, and pharmaceutical units across India. The motor housing, terminal box, windings, and bearings are engineered with enhanced creepage and clearance distances, reinforced insulation, and precision tolerances that maintain safety margins even under fault conditions.</p>\n<p>Available in power ratings spanning fractional HP up to 200 kW with frame sizes from IEC 80 to 315M, these motors are IECEx and PESO certified for use across petroleum, chemical, fertilizer, and offshore industries. Standard configurations include B3 foot-mounted and B5 flange-mounted variants with IP55 protection and Class F insulation as default.</p>\n<p>As Crompton’s authorized industrial distributor since 1957, BES provides factory documentation, certificate of conformity, installation guidance, and post-sale service across Mumbai, Ahmedabad, and pan-India locations. Contact our hazardous-area motor specialists for application engineering and ATEX/IECEx zone classification advice.</p>','increased-safety-motors-ex-ec-lv.webp',1),(103,26,'Smoke Extraction Motors','smoke-extraction-motors','High-Temperature Fire-Rated Motors (F300/F400)','<p>Smoke Extraction Motors are specialised induction motors engineered to run continuously at extremely high temperatures during fire emergencies, evacuating smoke, heat, and toxic gases from buildings, tunnels, car parks, and industrial facilities. Built to European standards EN 12101-3, these motors are rated F300 (300°C for 2 hours), F400 (400°C for 2 hours), and F600 (600°C for 1 hour) depending on application requirements.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton smoke extraction motors that comply with Indian fire safety regulations and meet the demands of architects, MEP consultants, and HVAC contractors working on metro stations, shopping malls, hospitals, IT parks, multilevel parking, and tunnel ventilation projects across Mumbai, Ahmedabad, and surrounding regions.</p>\n<p>Construction features high-temperature class H insulation, special-grease bearings, anti-corrosion paint, fire-rated terminal boxes with ceramic terminal blocks, and impregnated stator windings designed to retain dielectric strength at elevated temperatures. Available in single-speed and two-speed (Dahlander) configurations, suitable for direct-drive impeller fans up to 90 kW.</p>\n<p>As your authorised Crompton distributor since 1957, BES handles project specification review, lead-time coordination, and on-site commissioning support. Quick delivery from our Mumbai and Ahmedabad stocks for replacement and new-build fire safety systems.</p>','smoke-extraction-motors.webp',1),(104,26,'Fire Fighting UL Listed Motors','fire-fighting-ul-listed-motors','UL/FM Approved Pump Motors for Fire Protection','<p>Fire Fighting UL Listed Motors are TEFC three-phase induction motors specifically designed and certified to drive fire protection pumps in accordance with NFPA 20 standards. These motors carry UL listings and FM approvals, making them the mandatory choice for fire safety installations in commercial buildings, refineries, airports, data centres, and industrial complexes.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate offers Crompton’s UL-listed fire pump motor range built specifically for reliable, instant-start performance during fire emergencies. Each motor is engineered for service factor 1.15, NEMA-design B torque characteristics, and continuous duty operation, with terminal boxes positioned for easy fire-pump controller wiring.</p>\n<p>Frame sizes from NEMA 140 through 580 cover horsepower ratings from 5 HP to 500 HP at standard voltages (415V, 690V, 3300V). Construction includes oversized bearings rated for 100,000 hours L10 life, Class F insulation with Class B temperature rise, and high-grade cast-iron frames suitable for both vertical and horizontal mounting configurations.</p>\n<p>BES has supplied fire pump motors to leading EPC contractors, oil marketing companies, and metro projects since 1957. We provide UL certification documents, hydrotest reports, and dedicated logistics for time-critical fire safety projects across India.</p>','fire-fighting-ul-listed-motors.webp',1),(105,26,'Roller Table Motors','roller-table-motors','Heavy-Duty Motors for Steel Rolling Mills','<p>Roller Table Motors are heavy-duty squirrel-cage induction motors purpose-built to drive the conveyor rollers that move red-hot billets, slabs, and ingots through steel rolling mills. Engineered for high ambient temperatures, dust, vibration, and frequent reversing duty, these motors are the workhorses of the steel industry.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton roller table motors used in integrated steel plants, re-rolling mills, and forging units. Construction features extra-rigid frames, oversized shafts with sealed bearing housings, high-class insulation (H or higher), and forced-cooling provisions to withstand mill-floor ambient temperatures of 50°C and above.</p>\n<p>Mechanical features include reinforced shafts to withstand impact loads, double-sealed grease-packed bearings, drain plugs, and corrosion-resistant terminal boxes. Electrical design accommodates frequent starts, reversals, and plugging operations typical of rolling mill duty cycles. Available in ratings from 7.5 kW to 110 kW across NEMA and IEC frames.</p>\n<p>BES has been the trusted Crompton distributor to Maharashtra and Gujarat re-rolling sectors since 1957. We stock common ratings and provide rapid replacement service to minimise mill downtime. Customised configurations available on request through our technical sales team.</p>','roller-table-motors.webp',1),(106,26,'Crusher Application Motors','crusher-application-motors','High-Starting-Torque Motors for Stone & Mineral Crushers','<p>Crusher Application Motors are heavy-duty three-phase induction motors engineered to handle the brutal start-up conditions, shock loads, and continuous high-torque demands of stone crushers, jaw crushers, cone crushers, hammer mills, and other mineral processing equipment. Designed for service factor 1.15+ with NEMA Design C / Design D torque characteristics for high break-away requirements.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton crusher motors trusted by quarries, ready-mix concrete plants, cement units, ore-processing facilities, and infrastructure contractors across India. These motors feature reinforced shafts, oversized bearings, sealed terminal boxes (IP55+), and Class F or H insulation to survive dust ingress, vibration, and ambient temperatures up to 55°C.</p>\n<p>Available across power ranges from 7.5 kW to 315 kW with frame sizes from 132M to 355L in cast-iron construction. Each motor includes anti-condensation heaters as standard, RTD/PTC thermal protection options, and special foundation provisions to handle vibration loads characteristic of crusher operations.</p>\n<p>BES brings 67 years of industrial motor expertise to crusher operators. Our team helps select correct frame size, starting method (DOL, star-delta, soft-start, VFD), and accessories. Ready stock, on-site failure diagnostics, and rewinding-replacement coordination available across Maharashtra, Gujarat, and pan-India.</p>','crusher-application-motors.webp',1),(107,26,'Compressor Duty Motors','compressor-duty-motors','Motors Engineered for Air & Refrigeration Compressors','<p>Compressor Duty Motors are purpose-engineered three-phase induction motors that drive reciprocating, screw, and scroll air compressors as well as refrigeration compressors. These motors handle the unique demands of compressor applications: high starting torque against pressurised systems, frequent on-off cycling, continuous heavy loading, and elevated ambient temperatures in mechanical rooms.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton compressor duty motors used by air compressor manufacturers, OEM packagers, refrigeration plant operators, and pharmaceutical & food processing units. Construction includes Class F insulation, IP55 protection, oversized double-shielded bearings, and special-grade enamelled wire to handle the thermal stress of cyclic operation.</p>\n<p>Standard ratings span 1 HP to 300 HP at 415V/3-phase/50Hz with frame sizes covering 80 to 355L. Mounting configurations include B3 foot-mounted for belt-driven packages and B5/B14 flange-mounted for direct-coupled OEM compressor blocks. Single-phase versions also available for small workshop and household compressors.</p>\n<p>As Crompton’s long-standing authorised distributor, BES supplies tested-and-certified compressor motors with full warranty backing. We support compressor OEMs with batch deliveries, custom nameplates, and just-in-time logistics from Mumbai and Ahmedabad warehouses.</p>','compressor-duty-motors.webp',1),(108,25,'Hazardous Area Motors (Umbrella Range)','hazardous-area-motors-umbrella','Complete Range of Ex db, Ex eb, Ex nA, Ex pz HV Motors','<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies the complete Crompton hazardous-area motor portfolio for High Voltage applications across Zone 1, Zone 2, Zone 21, and Zone 22 classifications. Our range covers flame-proof (Ex db), increased safety (Ex eb), non-sparking (Ex nA/ec), and pressurised (Ex pz) construction types — all certified to IEC 60079, IECEx, and ATEX standards.</p>\n<p>HV hazardous-area motors are deployed in oil & gas exploration, refineries, petrochemicals, chemical processing, paint manufacturing, grain handling, and coal-fired power plants where explosive gas, vapour, or dust atmospheres are present. These motors are precision-engineered to contain any internal explosion, prevent ignition sources, or eliminate the ignition risk altogether depending on the protection technique.</p>\n<p>Power ratings span 75 kW to over 12 MW with operating voltages from 3.3 kV to 11 kV. Construction includes flameproof flange joints with precision tolerances, terminal boxes certified as Ex db / Ex eb enclosures, anti-condensation heaters, bearing insulation for VFD compatibility, and RTD/winding temperature monitoring as standard.</p>\n<p>BES brings 67 years of authorised Crompton distributorship experience to your HV hazardous area projects. We provide project documentation, certificate management (PESO, IECEx, ATEX), installation supervision, and ongoing maintenance contracts. Contact us for application-specific sizing and area classification consultancy.</p>','hazardous-area-motors-umbrella.webp',1),(109,25,'Pressurized Motors Ex px / pz (HV)','pressurized-motors-ex-px-pz-hv','Pressurised Enclosure HV Motors for Zone 1 / Zone 2','<p>Pressurized Motors Ex px and Ex pz use a continuous flow of clean air or inert gas inside the motor enclosure to prevent ingress of flammable atmospheres — eliminating the ignition source rather than containing an explosion. This is a preferred protection technique for very large HV motors and applications where flameproof construction is impractical due to size or weight.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton Ex px (Zone 1) and Ex pz (Zone 2) pressurised motors used in petrochemical complexes, gas compressor stations, offshore platforms, paint manufacturing units, and large refinery rotating equipment. The motors are supplied with integrated pressurisation kit, pressure switches, purge timers, and safety control panels per IEC 60079-2 standards.</p>\n<p>Standard ratings range from 200 kW up to 12 MW at 3.3 kV, 6.6 kV, and 11 kV. Construction includes welded steel housings, gland plates with EEx d-certified cable entries, anti-condensation heaters, bearing insulation, and full instrumentation (PT100s, vibration probes, bearing temperature sensors). Pressurisation can be air, nitrogen, or inert gas sourced from instrument-air systems.</p>\n<p>BES coordinates end-to-end project delivery with full IECEx/ATEX documentation, factory acceptance testing (FAT), installation drawings, and commissioning. Our 67-year Crompton partnership gives you reliable supply for greenfield projects and revamp programmes alike.</p>','pressurized-motor-hv-ex-p.webp',1),(110,20,'Synchronous Motors','synchronous-motors','Large Synchronous Motors for Constant-Speed High-Power Applications','<p>Synchronous Motors run at exact synchronous speed dictated by supply frequency and pole count — making them the preferred choice for compressor, mill, mixer, and pump drives where constant speed and power factor correction matter. Unlike induction motors, synchronous machines can operate at unity or leading power factor, contributing reactive power compensation to the plant electrical system.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton synchronous motors deployed in cement plants, paper mills, refineries, marine propulsion, large air compressors, and process industry applications across India. Available with brushless excitation (standard) or static excitation systems, these motors deliver high efficiency (typically 96-98%), inherent power factor improvement, and excellent overload capability.</p>\n<p>Power ratings range from 500 kW to over 15 MW at standard HV ratings 3.3 kV, 6.6 kV, 11 kV, and 13.8 kV. Pole configurations from 4-pole through 60-pole accommodate speeds from 100 rpm to 1500 rpm. Construction includes salient-pole or cylindrical-rotor design, forced-air or water cooling (IC81W, IC86W), brushless rotating exciter, and complete instrumentation including stator/rotor RTDs, bearing temperature sensors, and vibration probes.</p>\n<p>BES has supplied synchronous motors to leading EPC contractors and process industries since 1957. Our engineering team supports application sizing, starting-method selection (reduced-voltage, VFD, soft-start), excitation panel coordination, and on-site commissioning. Aftermarket spares, rotor balancing, and rewinding services available through our pan-India service network.</p>','synchronous-motors.webp',1),(111,108,'NEMA B42/B48 Frame Motors','nema-b42-b48-frame-motors','Compact NEMA Frame Motors for OEM & Equipment Applications','<p>NEMA B42/B48 Frame Motors are compact-footprint single-phase and three-phase induction motors built to NEMA dimensional standards, popular for North American export equipment and OEM applications globally. These small-frame motors deliver 1/4 HP to 1.5 HP at standard NEMA voltages (115/230V single-phase, 200/230/460V three-phase) with frame dimensions per NEMA MG 1 specifications.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton-make NEMA B42 and B48 frame motors used by export-oriented OEMs, equipment manufacturers, and aftermarket replacement segments. Typical applications include small pumps, fans, blowers, conveyors, agitators, and packaging machinery — anywhere a compact NEMA-dimensioned motor is required for domestic or international equipment builds.</p>\n<p>Construction features include rolled-steel or aluminium frames, sealed ball bearings, Class B/F insulation, IP44/IP54 protection, and NEMA-standard shaft extensions (5/8\" and 1/2\" keyed). Mounting variants include resilient-base, rigid-base, C-flange, and ODP (open drip-proof) for indoor applications.</p>\n<p>BES offers ready stock for common ratings and short-lead deliveries for project quantities. As Crompton’s authorised distributor since 1957, we provide certified test reports, NEMA compliance documentation, and OEM packaging for direct-export shipments from Mumbai and Ahmedabad.</p>','nema-b42-b48-frame-motors.webp',1),(112,108,'NEMA 56 Frame Motors','nema-56-frame-motors','Versatile General-Purpose NEMA 56 Frame Motors','<p>NEMA 56 Frame Motors are the most widely deployed small industrial motors in North American specifications — used across pumps, fans, compressors, machinery, and consumer/commercial equipment. The NEMA 56 frame (5.5\" centerline height) accommodates power ratings from 1/3 HP through 3 HP in both single-phase and three-phase configurations.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton NEMA 56 frame motors widely used by Indian OEMs serving export markets (USA, Canada, Mexico, Latin America), and by domestic industries adopting NEMA standards for equipment compatibility. Available in C-face, C-flange, rigid-base, and resilient-base mounting variants with both standard and high-efficiency designs.</p>\n<p>Standard voltage configurations cover 115/230V single-phase (capacitor-start, capacitor-run, PSC) and 208-230/460V three-phase. Frame construction includes rolled-steel housings with cast aluminium end-shields, sealed ball bearings, Class F insulation, and IP44 protection (higher IP available on request). Conduit box positioning standard at F1, F2, F3 per NEMA specifications.</p>\n<p>BES holds inventory of common NEMA 56 motor ratings for quick OEM delivery. We provide ECC&I duty rating documentation, UL/CSA compliance certificates, and dimensional drawings to support customer technical reviews. Quantity discounts available for production orders.</p>','nema-56-frame-motors.webp',1),(113,108,'100S Frame Motors','100s-frame-motors','Standardised 100S Frame Industrial Motors','<p>100S Frame Motors are standardised industrial induction motors built to IEC 100S dimensional specifications, offering 2.2 kW (3 HP) capacity in a compact, interchangeable frame size. The \"S\" designation refers to short-shaft length variant of the 100-frame family, used where space-constrained installations require predictable mounting dimensions.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton 100S frame motors used in machine tools, packaging equipment, water treatment plants, HVAC installations, and small industrial machinery. The standardised IEC dimensions ensure direct replacement compatibility with installed equipment from any IEC-compliant motor manufacturer.</p>\n<p>Available in 2-pole (2880 rpm), 4-pole (1440 rpm), and 6-pole (960 rpm) configurations at 415V/3-phase/50Hz with Class F insulation and IP55 protection as standard. Frame material options include aluminium die-cast (lighter, corrosion-resistant) and cast iron (more durable, heavier-duty applications). Mounting variants: B3 foot, B5 flange, B14 face, B35 combined.</p>\n<p>BES stocks 100S frame motors for immediate dispatch. With 67 years as Crompton’s authorised industrial distributor, we offer technical specification support, batch order pricing, and customised nameplate / labelling for OEM customers building standard machinery.</p>','100s-frame-motors.webp',1),(114,109,'RHINO Series CI Body Motors','rhino-series-ci-body-motors','Rugged Cast-Iron Body Three-Phase Induction Motors','<p>RHINO Series Cast Iron Body Motors are Crompton’s flagship general-purpose three-phase induction motors built for tough Indian industrial environments. The cast-iron frame construction delivers exceptional mechanical strength, heat dissipation, and vibration damping — making these motors the preferred choice for continuous-duty applications in process industries, machine shops, and infrastructure projects.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies the RHINO range across power ratings from 0.37 kW (0.5 HP) through 200 kW (270 HP) in IEC frame sizes 71 to 315M. Construction features high-grade cast-iron frames, endshields, and terminal boxes; high-quality stator stampings; double-shielded bearings rated for 40,000-hour L10 life; and Class F insulation with Class B temperature rise design (giving extra thermal margin).</p>\n<p>Available in 2-pole through 8-pole configurations, IP55 protection (higher IP on request), and standard B3 foot or B5/B14 flange mounting. Voltage configurations include 415V±10%/50Hz as standard, with multi-voltage star-delta options. Efficiency levels meet IE2 and IE3 standards in line with Indian BEE labelling requirements.</p>\n<p>BES has supplied RHINO motors to thousands of plants across Mumbai, Ahmedabad, and pan-India since the range’s launch. We maintain comprehensive stock across common ratings, provide mounting drawings, dimensional sheets, and electrical test certificates with every supply. Replacement and OEM bulk-order programmes available.</p>','rhino-series-ci-body-motors.webp',1),(115,109,'SHEETAL Series CI Body Motors','sheetal-series-ci-body-motors','Economical Cast-Iron Body Three-Phase Motors','<p>SHEETAL Series Cast Iron Body Motors offer Crompton-engineered three-phase induction performance at an economy-grade price point — making them the ideal choice for general-purpose industrial applications where reliability and value are both priorities. These motors deliver dependable service in textile mills, food processing, agricultural equipment, small workshops, and standard pump/fan duties.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies the SHEETAL range covering 0.37 kW to 30 kW (0.5 HP to 40 HP) with IEC frame sizes 71 through 200L. Construction uses cast-iron frame and end-shields, durable double-shielded bearings, Class F insulation, and IP55 enclosure protection — the same core engineering as the RHINO range, value-optimised for cost-sensitive applications.</p>\n<p>Standard pole counts include 2-pole (~2880 rpm), 4-pole (~1440 rpm), and 6-pole (~960 rpm) at 415V/3-phase/50Hz, with foot-mounted (B3) and flange-mounted (B5, B14) variants. Efficiency complies with IE2 minimum standards. Suitable for direct-on-line (DOL) and star-delta starting on three-phase networks.</p>\n<p>BES offers SHEETAL motors with same-day dispatch from Mumbai and Ahmedabad stock for common ratings. As Crompton’s authorised industrial distributor since 1957, we provide test certificates, performance curves, and dimensional drawings. Bulk orders for OEMs and contractors qualify for volume pricing.</p>','sheetal-series-ci-body-motors.webp',1),(116,109,'ELiTE Series IEC Aluminium Die-cast Body Motors','elite-series-iec-aluminium-diecast-motors','Lightweight Aluminium Die-cast Body Three-Phase Motors','<p>ELiTE Series Aluminium Die-cast Body Motors offer Crompton’s premium engineering in a lighter, corrosion-resistant aluminium frame — ideal for applications requiring portable machinery, marine-grade resistance, or weight-sensitive installations. The high-pressure die-cast aluminium construction delivers superior thermal conductivity (cooler running motors), excellent surface finish, and natural corrosion resistance.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies ELiTE motors across IEC frames 63 through 160L with power ratings from 0.18 kW (0.25 HP) through 18.5 kW (25 HP). These motors are ideal for HVAC systems, packaging machinery, food and beverage equipment, marine applications, water treatment plants, and clean-room environments where the aluminium body provides hygiene and aesthetic advantages over cast iron.</p>\n<p>Construction features include die-cast aluminium frame and end-shields, integral cooling fins, sealed ball bearings, Class F insulation, IP55 protection, and integrally die-cast rotor cage for vibration-free operation. Available in 2/4/6 pole configurations, B3/B5/B14 mounting, and conforms to IE2/IE3 efficiency standards per IEC 60034-30.</p>\n<p>BES stocks ELiTE series for fast OEM and industrial deliveries. Our 67-year Crompton partnership ensures genuine product supply with full warranty backing, technical specification support, and dimensional drawings for system integration.</p>','elite-series-iec-aluminium-diecast-motors.webp',1),(117,109,'Comfort Plus Series Aluminium Extruded Body Motors','comfort-plus-aluminium-extruded-body-motors','Aluminium-Extruded Frame Premium-Efficiency Motors','<p>Comfort Plus Series Aluminium Extruded Body Motors combine Crompton’s premium induction motor engineering with an advanced extruded aluminium frame technology. The extruded body offers superior heat dissipation through finned construction, dimensional precision via extrusion process, and weight savings of up to 40% compared to cast-iron equivalents — all while maintaining mechanical robustness for industrial duty.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Comfort Plus motors used in HVAC plant rooms, light industrial machinery, water treatment skids, food processing equipment, and OEM-built integrated systems where every kilogram of weight matters. The smooth extruded surface also offers easier cleaning — important in pharma, dairy, and food processing environments.</p>\n<p>Available in IEC frame sizes 80 through 180M with ratings from 0.55 kW to 22 kW. Standard configurations include 2/4/6 pole, B3/B5/B14 mounting, IP55 protection, Class F insulation, and IE2/IE3 efficiency compliance. The extruded design enables larger cooling-fin surface area resulting in cooler operation and extended bearing/insulation life.</p>\n<p>BES offers Comfort Plus motors with technical pre-sales support including 3D models for system integration, performance curves, and noise/vibration data. Inventory maintained at Mumbai and Ahmedabad branches for short-lead-time deliveries.</p>','comfort-plus-aluminium-extruded-body-motors.webp',1),(118,104,'Motors for Domestic Appliances','motors-for-domestic-appliances','OEM Motors for Household & Consumer Appliances','<p>Motors for Domestic Appliances are precision-engineered fractional-HP electric motors used inside household equipment such as mixers, grinders, washing machines, food processors, refrigerators, water purifiers, and exhaust fans. These motors are built to OEM specifications with strict requirements on noise, vibration, electromagnetic emissions, and consumer-safety compliance.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton OEM motors to leading appliance manufacturers across India. Available in shaded-pole, PSC (Permanent Split Capacitor), capacitor-start, and universal motor configurations — each optimised for specific consumer applications. Power range typically spans 25W to 1 HP at 230V single-phase, with high-grade enamelled copper windings, low-loss steel laminations, and balanced rotor assemblies.</p>\n<p>Construction features include impact-resistant plastic or aluminium housings, sealed bearings rated for 5000-10000 operating hours, integral thermal cut-outs, and EMI/RFI suppression circuitry. Each motor type carries IS/IEC compliance certificates and meets BIS safety standards for household appliances.</p>\n<p>BES partners with appliance OEMs for both standard motor supply and custom-engineered solutions including custom shaft profiles, special mounting brackets, branded labelling, and just-in-time delivery from our Mumbai and Ahmedabad warehouses. 67 years of Crompton industrial expertise applied to consumer appliance motor requirements.</p>','motors-for-domestic-appliances.webp',1),(119,24,'Brushless DC Motors (BLDC)','brushless-dc-motors-bldc','High-Efficiency BLDC Motors for Modern Applications','<p>Brushless DC (BLDC) Motors deliver superior efficiency, longer lifespan, lower noise, and precise speed control compared to brushed DC or induction motor counterparts. By eliminating mechanical brushes and commutators, BLDC motors offer maintenance-free operation, higher torque density, and electronic controllability that makes them ideal for modern energy-conscious applications.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton BLDC motors used in HVAC equipment (ceiling fans, blowers, air handlers), industrial automation, robotics, electric mobility (e-bikes, e-rickshaws), pumps, conveyor systems, and battery-powered tools. Efficiency typically reaches 85-95% — significantly higher than equivalent induction motors — translating directly to energy savings and lower lifetime cost.</p>\n<p>Available in power ratings from 25W through 5 kW with operating voltages of 12V/24V/48V/72V DC. Each motor includes integrated Hall-effect sensors for accurate rotor position feedback, supports PWM speed control via external drive electronics, and offers IP54/IP65 protection options. Inrunner and outrunner configurations available based on application requirements.</p>\n<p>BES supports BLDC motor integration with sizing assistance, drive electronics recommendations, and integration consultancy for OEMs developing energy-efficient products. We hold stock of common ratings for rapid deployment, with custom-engineered variants available through Crompton’s factory engineering team.</p>','brushless-dc-motors-bldc.webp',1),(120,24,'Hub Motors for Electric Cycles','hub-motors-for-electric-cycles','BLDC Hub Motors for E-Bikes & Light Electric Vehicles','<p>Hub Motors for Electric Cycles are BLDC motors integrated directly into the wheel hub of an electric bicycle or light electric vehicle, eliminating the need for chains, sprockets, or external drive systems. This direct-drive architecture delivers silent operation, mechanical simplicity, regenerative braking capability, and clean styling — all ideal for modern e-mobility.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton-make hub motors used by e-bike manufacturers, e-rickshaw builders, scooter integrators, and personal mobility device makers. Available in front-hub and rear-hub configurations, with power ratings of 250W (legally road-allowed in India for unregistered e-bikes), 500W, 750W, 1000W, and 1500W — covering the full spectrum of urban commute electric vehicles.</p>\n<p>Each hub motor includes integrated Hall sensors, internal planetary gear reduction (geared hubs) or direct-drive design, sealed bearings, and IP65 weather protection. Compatible with 36V/48V/60V battery systems and standard sine-wave or square-wave BLDC controllers. Wheel sizes from 16\" through 28\" available to match different e-bike form factors.</p>\n<p>BES partners with e-mobility OEMs and EV assembly workshops to source quality hub motors with predictable lead times and post-sale support. Quantity pricing available for production runs. Technical assistance with controller-motor matching, battery sizing, and regulatory compliance available through our automation team.</p>','hub-motors-for-electric-cycles.webp',1),(121,104,'Transformer Cooling Fan Motors','transformer-cooling-fan-motors','Specialised Fan Motors for Power Transformer Cooling','<p>Transformer Cooling Fan Motors are purpose-built three-phase induction motors that drive the cooling fans on large power transformers, ensuring radiator surfaces maintain heat-rejection performance under full-load and emergency overload conditions. Designed for outdoor operation in extreme weather, these motors must run reliably for years with minimal maintenance.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton transformer cooling fan motors used by power utilities, distribution companies, industrial captive power plants, and EHV substation operators. Specifications match transformer manufacturer requirements: typical ratings 0.37 kW to 2.2 kW, low-noise design, hot-dip galvanised hardware, and TEFC enclosure with IP55 protection minimum.</p>\n<p>Construction features include heavy-duty cast-aluminium or cast-iron frames, sealed permanently-greased bearings for 40,000+ hour life, marine-grade paint systems for coastal/humid environments, integrated condensation drain plugs, and weatherproof terminal boxes with hot-dip galvanised cable glands. Class F or H insulation withstands ambient temperatures up to 55°C.</p>\n<p>BES supplies transformer fan motors as both new-build OEM orders to transformer manufacturers and as direct-replacement units to utilities/maintenance contractors. We coordinate with original motor nameplate data for precise drop-in replacements. Pan-India delivery through Mumbai and Ahmedabad warehouses.</p>','transformer-cooling-fan-motors.webp',1),(122,104,'Poultry Fan Motors','poultry-fan-motors','Corrosion-Resistant Motors for Poultry Ventilation','<p>Poultry Fan Motors are corrosion-resistant induction motors engineered to drive the large exhaust and tunnel ventilation fans in commercial poultry farms, broiler houses, layer farms, and hatcheries. Poultry environments expose motors to ammonia gases, high humidity, dust, feathers, and frequent washing — demanding specialised construction beyond standard industrial motors.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton poultry fan motors used by integrated poultry companies, contract farmers, and equipment installers across Maharashtra, Gujarat, Punjab, Andhra Pradesh, and pan-India. Construction features include high-grade aluminium die-cast or epoxy-coated cast iron frames, stainless-steel shafts, hot-dip galvanised hardware, sealed bearings with extended-life lithium grease, and IP55 minimum protection (IP66 available).</p>\n<p>Available in 0.55 kW through 5.5 kW ratings at 415V/3-phase/50Hz and 230V/1-phase variants for smaller exhaust fans. Class F insulation with double-vacuum varnish impregnation withstands the corrosive ammonia atmospheres typical of poultry sheds. Special-coated windings extend life by 2-3× compared to standard industrial motors in similar environments.</p>\n<p>BES brings 67 years of motor engineering expertise to the poultry industry, providing not just motors but complete sizing and selection advice for ventilation system designers. Replacement programmes for aging fan motors available with quick-ship delivery from our Mumbai and Ahmedabad stocks.</p>','poultry-fan-motors.webp',1),(123,104,'Pulveriser and Gravy Motors','pulveriser-and-gravy-motors','Heavy-Duty Motors for Spice Mills & Food Pulverisers','<p>Pulveriser and Gravy Motors are robust three-phase induction motors designed to drive spice pulverising mills, gravy/masala grinders, atta chakkis, and food processing equipment used in commercial kitchens, hotel chains, food manufacturing, and small-scale flour milling. These motors handle the high starting torque, dust loading, and continuous-duty operation typical of grinding applications.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton pulveriser motors to spice mill operators, masala manufacturers, food processing units, and equipment OEMs across India. Standard ratings range from 1 HP through 25 HP at 415V/3-phase, with 1-phase variants available for smaller domestic-commercial mills. Class F insulation, IP55 protection, and oversized bearings handle the dusty, heat-loaded environment.</p>\n<p>Construction features include high-grade cast-iron or aluminium frames, double-shielded bearings, special-grade grease for high-temperature operation, and reinforced shafts to handle shock loads from grinding action. Anti-condensation heaters and thermistor protection available as options. Mounting variants: B3 foot for belt-driven mills and B5 flange for direct-coupled units.</p>\n<p>BES carries pulveriser motor stock across common ratings for rapid replacement to keep mill downtime minimal. Our 67-year Crompton partnership ensures genuine product supply with full warranty. Bulk-order pricing available for mill builders and food processing OEMs.</p>','pulveriser-and-gravy-motors.webp',1),(124,104,'Pressure Washing Pump Motors','pressure-washing-pump-motors','Wet-Environment Motors for High-Pressure Cleaning Pumps','<p>Pressure Washing Pump Motors drive the high-pressure pumps used in car wash facilities, industrial cleaning equipment, building maintenance, drain jetting machines, and agricultural sprayers. These motors operate in wet, splash-prone environments and must handle frequent on-off cycling from operator trigger control — both demanding robust construction and electrical design.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton pressure washing pump motors used in car detailing chains, building maintenance contractors, industrial cleaning service providers, and OEM pressure washer manufacturers. Available in 1 HP through 10 HP ratings at 230V single-phase and 415V three-phase, in both standard duty and continuous duty variants.</p>\n<p>Construction features include IP55 (water splash) protection minimum (IP56/IP65 available), corrosion-resistant aluminium or epoxy-coated cast iron frames, stainless-steel shafts, sealed-for-life double-shielded bearings, and anti-condensation drain plugs. Capacitor-start designs in single-phase variants ensure high starting torque against pump head pressure. Class F insulation with vacuum-impregnated windings.</p>\n<p>BES provides pressure washing motors with quick-ship logistics from Mumbai and Ahmedabad. For OEM pressure washer manufacturers, we offer batched delivery, custom nameplates, and special mounting configurations. Replacement units coordinated to match original equipment specifications.</p>','pressure-washing-pump-motors.webp',1),(125,102,'Single Phase Brake Motors','single-phase-brake-motors','Single-Phase Motors with Integrated Electromagnetic Brake','<p>Single Phase Brake Motors integrate an electromagnetic brake assembly directly into a single-phase induction motor, providing instant stopping action when power is removed — critical for safety-sensitive applications, precise positioning equipment, and hold-on-stop requirements in single-phase electrical environments. The spring-applied, electromagnetically-released brake design ensures fail-safe operation even on power loss.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton single-phase brake motors used in workshops, packaging machinery, small hoists/lifts, conveyors, gates and doors, machine tools, and any equipment where motion must stop precisely or hold-on-stop position is required. The integrated brake eliminates the need for separate braking systems, simplifying machine design.</p>\n<p>Available in 0.18 kW through 2.2 kW (0.25 HP through 3 HP) at 230V/1-phase/50Hz. Brake torque is typically rated at 150-200% of motor full-load torque, ensuring positive stopping under load. Construction features include capacitor-start or capacitor-run motor designs, DC-released electromagnetic brake, manual release lever (for emergencies), and IP54 protection.</p>\n<p>BES supplies single-phase brake motors to machinery OEMs and aftermarket users with quick-ship delivery. Application engineering support available for brake-torque sizing, duty-cycle analysis, and brake-wear-life estimation. Pan-India service through our Mumbai and Ahmedabad branches.</p>','single-phase-brake-motors.webp',1),(126,104,'HVAC Motors','hvac-motors','Motors for HVAC Air Handling Units, Fan Coil & AHU Applications','<p>HVAC Motors are specialised three-phase and single-phase induction motors engineered for Heating, Ventilation, and Air Conditioning applications — driving air handling units (AHUs), fan coil units, cooling tower fans, condenser fans, and chiller pumps in commercial HVAC systems. These motors operate in clean indoor environments with quiet, vibration-free performance and high efficiency.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton HVAC motors used in commercial buildings, IT parks, hospitals, shopping malls, hotels, airports, and industrial cleanrooms across India. Available across the full spectrum: shaded-pole motors for small fan-coil units (25W-100W), PSC motors for medium fans (100W-750W), and three-phase induction motors for AHUs and large equipment (0.55 kW to 75 kW).</p>\n<p>Construction features include precision-balanced rotors for low vibration, oversized bearings rated for 60,000+ hour L10 life, Class F insulation, IP54 protection, low-noise design (typically below 65 dB), and VFD-compatible variants for variable air volume (VAV) applications. Special silicone-grease bearings available for cleanroom and pharmaceutical applications.</p>\n<p>BES partners with HVAC contractors, MEP consultants, and equipment OEMs to supply matched motor solutions for new construction and retrofit projects. Energy-efficient IE2/IE3 versions available for green-building (LEED, GRIHA) compliant projects. Quick logistics from Mumbai and Ahmedabad for project schedules.</p>','hvac-motors.webp',1),(127,104,'Wood Working Motors','wood-working-motors','High-Speed Motors for Saws, Planers & Wood Machinery','<p>Wood Working Motors are heavy-duty three-phase induction motors purpose-built for woodworking machinery including band saws, table saws, planers, jointers, routers, shapers, and CNC wood-cutting machines. These motors handle the high-speed operation, dust-loaded environment, and frequent start-stop cycling characteristic of carpentry workshops and furniture manufacturing.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton wood working motors used by furniture manufacturers, carpentry workshops, plywood plants, modular kitchen builders, and joinery contractors across Maharashtra, Gujarat, and pan-India. Available in 1 HP through 25 HP ratings at 415V/3-phase/50Hz with single-phase variants for smaller equipment.</p>\n<p>Construction features TEFC enclosure with IP55 protection (dust ingress critical in woodworking), Class F insulation, sealed bearings with dust seals, reinforced shafts to handle high RPM operation (2-pole motors at ~2880 rpm common for saw drives), and oversized terminal boxes for VFD speed-control wiring. Hot-dip galvanised hardware resists humidity in coastal wood-processing locations.</p>\n<p>BES stocks wood working motors in common ratings for same-day dispatch to workshops needing rapid replacement. Our team supports motor-machine matching for new builds and retrofit applications. 67 years of Crompton expertise applied to keep your woodworking operations running.</p>','wood-working-motors.webp',1),(128,104,'Rice Huller Motors','rice-huller-motors','Heavy-Duty Motors for Rice Hulling & Polishing Mills','<p>Rice Huller Motors are heavy-duty three-phase induction motors designed for the rigorous demands of paddy hulling, rice polishing, and rice mill operations. These motors handle continuous-duty operation in extremely dusty environments while delivering high starting torque to overcome the inertia of loaded hulling drums, polishing chambers, and grader screens.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton rice huller motors to rice mills, paddy processing units, integrated grain handling facilities, and equipment manufacturers across India’s rice-growing belt. Available in 5 HP through 60 HP ratings at 415V/3-phase/50Hz with both standard duty and continuous duty (S1) variants depending on mill operation patterns.</p>\n<p>Construction features include heavy cast-iron or rolled-steel body construction, TEFC enclosure with IP55 protection minimum, Class F insulation, double-shielded bearings with extended-life lithium grease, and reinforced shafts to handle shock loads from grain processing. Anti-condensation heaters available for mills in humid coastal regions or monsoon-prone areas.</p>\n<p>BES has supplied rice mill motors to paddy processors across India since 1957 — our long Crompton partnership gives us insight into the unique demands of grain processing. Spare motor inventory available for fast deployment, minimising mill downtime during harvest peaks. Bulk pricing for mill upgrade projects.</p>','rice-huller-motors.webp',1),(129,20,'Squirrel Cage Induction Motors (HV)','squirrel-cage-induction-motors-hv','Large HV Squirrel Cage Induction Motors for Heavy Industry','<p>Squirrel Cage Induction Motors are the most widely deployed motor technology in heavy industrial applications — simple, reliable, low-maintenance, and capable of handling severe-duty service for decades. In HV ratings (3.3 kV, 6.6 kV, 11 kV), they drive critical equipment including primary air fans, induced draft fans, boiler feed pumps, mill drives, chippers, blowers, and large process pumps.</p>\n<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton HV squirrel cage motors deployed in thermal power plants, cement plants, steel mills, paper mills, refineries, mining operations, and process industries. Available power ratings span 200 kW through 15 MW with operating speeds from 500 rpm to 3000 rpm via appropriate pole count selection.</p>\n<p>Construction features include welded fabricated-steel or cast-iron stator frames, vacuum-pressure-impregnated (VPI) stator windings, copper-bar squirrel cage rotors (no soldered joints), oil-film sleeve bearings for higher ratings, integral cooling fans for IC411/IC511 air-cooled designs, and complete monitoring instrumentation (PT100 stator RTDs, bearing temperature sensors, vibration probes, partial discharge sensors for larger units).</p>\n<p>BES provides full project lifecycle support: technical sizing, factory acceptance testing coordination, transportation logistics, site assembly supervision, commissioning support, and long-term maintenance contracts. 67-year Crompton partnership ensures genuine OEM supply with full backing for spares, service, and warranty support across India.</p>','squirrel-cage-induction-motors-hv.webp',1);
