rrigation for rural homes, farmhouses, and small farms across Maharashtra and Gujarat.</p><p>Built with corrosion-resistant construction for prolonged water immersion and energy-efficient hydraulics, the OWE12(1PH)C-28 is ISI-grade and suited to continuous agricultural and domestic duty. Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies it with genuine warranty and expert sizing support.</p>',NULL,'SP',NULL,NULL,'Yes','No','Openwell Submersible',1),(153,28,'4W1/7-BUE-D40','4w1-7-bue-d40','4w1-7-bue-d40.webp','<p>The 4W1/7-BUE-D40 is a Crompton borewell submersible pump engineered for deep-water extraction from 4-inch borewells. It lifts water reliably from significant depths for residential, farmhouse, and agricultural supply, with an oil/water-filled motor and multi-stage hydraulics for sustained head.</p><p>ISI-certified and MNRE-eligible where applicable, the 4W1/7-BUE-D40 handles Indian borewell conditions and voltage fluctuation dependably. Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies the pump with matched cable, control panel, and expert installation guidance from Mumbai and Ahmedabad.</p>',NULL,'SP',NULL,NULL,'Yes','No','Submersible Borewell',1),(154,30,'CFCHM6E1.5B-V24','cfchm6e1-5b-v24','cfchm6e1-5b-v24.webp','<p>The CFCHM6E1.5B-V24 is a Crompton pressure booster pump that solves weak water flow — delivering strong, consistent pressure to showers, taps, and appliances in homes, flats, societies, and commercial buildings. With automatic pressure control, it starts on demand and stops when taps close.</p><p>Compact, quiet, and energy-efficient, the CFCHM6E1.5B-V24 is ideal for Mumbai high-rises and Ahmedabad bungalows where mains pressure falls short. Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies it with expert sizing for your building and pan-India delivery.</p>',NULL,'SP',NULL,NULL,'Yes','No','Pressure Booster',1),(155,29,'OWE052(1PH)C-21','owe052-1ph-c-21','owe052-1ph-c-21.webp','<p>The OWE052(1PH)C-21 is a Crompton openwell submersible pump designed to run fully submerged in open dug wells, sumps, and tanks. With no priming needed and quiet underwater operation, it delivers reliable water supply and irrigation for rural homes, farmhouses, and small farms across Maharashtra and Gujarat.</p><p>Built with corrosion-resistant construction for prolonged water immersion and energy-efficient hydraulics, the OWE052(1PH)C-21 is ISI-grade and suited to continuous agricultural and domestic duty. Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies it with genuine warranty and expert sizing support.</p>',NULL,'SP',NULL,NULL,'Yes','No','Openwell Submersible',1),(156,24,'WIN DURA II','win-dura-ii','win-dura-ii.webp','<p>The WIN DURA II is a Crompton mini self-priming regenerative pump built for domestic water boosting and transfer — filling overhead tanks, boosting tap and shower pressure, and general household duty. Compact, quiet, and reliable, it self-primes without a foot valve for hassle-free installation in homes, flats, and small buildings.</p><p>Featuring brass impellers, energy-efficient stamping, and IP-protected motor construction, the WIN DURA II handles Indian voltage conditions and daily use dependably. Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies this genuine Crompton pump with warranty, expert selection, and pan-India delivery from our Mumbai and Ahmedabad offices.</p>',NULL,'SP',NULL,NULL,'Yes','No','Residential',1),(157,24,'ELITE PLUS I','elite-plus-i','elite-plus-i.webp','<p>The ELITE PLUS I is a Crompton mini self-priming regenerative pump built for domestic water boosting and transfer — filling overhead tanks, boosting tap and shower pressure, and general household duty. Compact, quiet, and reliable, it self-primes without a foot valve for hassle-free installation in homes, flats, and small buildings.</p><p>Featuring brass impellers, energy-efficient stamping, and IP-protected motor construction, the ELITE PLUS I handles Indian voltage conditions and daily use dependably. Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies this genuine Crompton pump with warranty, expert selection, and pan-India delivery from our Mumbai and Ahmedabad offices.</p>','1HP','SP',NULL,NULL,'Yes','No','Residential',1),(158,24,'WIN DURA I','win-dura-i','win-dura-i.webp','<p>The WIN DURA I is a Crompton mini self-priming regenerative pump built for domestic water boosting and transfer — filling overhead tanks, boosting tap and shower pressure, and general household duty. Compact, quiet, and reliable, it self-primes without a foot valve for hassle-free installation in homes, flats, and small buildings.</p><p>Featuring brass impellers, energy-efficient stamping, and IP-protected motor construction, the WIN DURA I handles Indian voltage conditions and daily use dependably. Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies this genuine Crompton pump with warranty, expert selection, and pan-India delivery from our Mumbai and Ahmedabad offices.</p>','1HP','SP',NULL,NULL,'Yes','No','Residential',1),(159,28,'4W1/8-BUE-D40','4w1-8-bue-d40','4w1-8-bue-d40.webp','<p>The 4W1/8-BUE-D40 is a Crompton borewell submersible pump engineered for deep-water extraction from 4-inch borewells. It lifts water reliably from significant depths for residential, farmhouse, and agricultural supply, with an oil/water-filled motor and multi-stage hydraulics for sustained head.</p><p>ISI-certified and MNRE-eligible where applicable, the 4W1/8-BUE-D40 handles Indian borewell conditions and voltage fluctuation dependably. Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies the pump with matched cable, control panel, and expert installation guidance from Mumbai and Ahmedabad.</p>','1HP','SP',NULL,NULL,'Yes','No','Submersible Borewell',1),(160,33,'Crompton Solar Submersible Pump','crompton-solar-submersible-pump','crompton-solar-submersible-pump.webp','<p>Crompton Solar Submersible Pumps run entirely on solar power — eliminating diesel cost and grid dependence for irrigation and water supply on farms and remote sites. Available from 2 HP to 10 HP in both AC and DC configurations, for total heads from 30 to 100 metres, these MNRE-listed pumps qualify for 60-90% capital subsidy under the PM-KUSUM scheme.</p><p>Each pump ships with an IP65 MPPT solar controller that extracts maximum power from the panels across the day. The mono-block submersible design delivers high water output through Indian summers with minimal maintenance. Select the right model by HP and head from the specification table below.</p><p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies the complete Crompton solar pump range with PM-KUSUM subsidy documentation support, correct sizing for your borewell and water requirement, and delivery across Maharashtra, Gujarat, and pan-India.</p>','2-10HP','AC/DC',NULL,NULL,'Yes','Yes','Solar Submersible',1),(161,31,'Crompton Solar Pump Controller','crompton-solar-pump-controller','crompton-solar-pump-controller.webp','<p>Crompton Solar Pump Controllers are IP65-rated MPPT drives that power and protect solar submersible pumps. The MPPT (Maximum Power Point Tracking) technology continuously extracts the maximum available power from the solar panels as sunlight varies through the day, maximising water output.</p><p>Available for 2 HP to 10 HP pumps in both AC and DC configurations, these weatherproof controllers include dry-run protection, over/under-voltage protection, and reverse-polarity safety. Match the controller to your solar pump rating from the specification table below.</p><p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies Crompton solar controllers matched to your pump, with PM-KUSUM subsidy support and Gujarat-wide delivery.</p>','2-10HP','AC/DC',NULL,NULL,'Yes','Yes','Solar Controller',1);
