,'http://localhost/samuraisec1.0/xadmin/mod/our-aim/x-our-aim.inc.php','{\"pageTitle\":\"Our AIM\",\"pageContent\":\"<div class=\\\"col-2\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"title\\\">\\r\\n<h2>Our AIM<\\/h2>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n\\r\\n<div class=\\\"row\\\">\\r\\n<p>Our primary AIM is to maximize long-term stockholder value, while adhering to the laws of the jurisdictions in which it operates and at all times observing the highest ethical standards.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>To supply outstanding service and solutions through dedication and excellence.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>As a company, and as individuals, we value integrity, honesty, openness, personal excellence, constructive self-criticism, continual self-improvement, and mutual respect. We are committed to our customers and partners and have a passion for technology. We take on big challenges, and pride ourselves on seeing them through. We hold ourselves accountable to our customers, shareholders, partners, and employees by honoring our commitments, providing results, and striving for the highest quality.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n\",\"synopsis\":\"\",\"templateFile\":\"\",\"metaTitle\":\"\",\"metaKeyword\":\"\",\"metaDesc\":\"\",\"xAction\":\"UPDATE\",\"modName\":\"our-aim\",\"pageType\":\"edit\",\"langCode\":\"en\",\"pageID\":\"8\"}','2023-03-09 13:44:50',NULL),(716,'http://localhost/samuraisec1.0/core/jwt.inc.php','{\"xAction\":\"mxValidateJwtToken\"}','2023-03-09 13:45:09',NULL),(717,'http://localhost/samuraisec1.0/xadmin/mod/about-us/x-about-us.inc.php','{\"pageTitle\":\"About Us\",\"pageContent\":\"<h4>Samurai Securities Pvt. Ltd.<\\/h4>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Since its inception in 2001, Samurai Securities Pvt. Ltd. has followed the most Important Rule of \\u201csupplying outstanding services and solutions through dedication and excellence\\u201d and till date in all aspects of our business this principle remains our prime focus.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Samurai Securities Private Limited (SSPL) is a member of the BSE Ltd (Formerly known as Bombay Stock Exchange Ltd.) National Stock Exchange of India Ltd. (NSE), Depository Participant with CDSL and Mutual funds distributor.<\\/p>\\r\\n\",\"synopsis\":\"<div class=\\\"col-2\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"title\\\">\\r\\n<h2><\\/h2>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n\",\"templateFile\":\"about-us-tpl\",\"metaTitle\":\"\",\"metaKeyword\":\"\",\"metaDesc\":\"\",\"xAction\":\"UPDATE\",\"modName\":\"about-us\",\"pageType\":\"edit\",\"langCode\":\"en\",\"pageID\":\"2\"}','2023-03-09 13:45:09',NULL),(718,'http://localhost/samuraisec1.0/core/jwt.inc.php','{\"xAction\":\"mxValidateJwtToken\"}','2023-03-09 13:45:25',NULL),(719,'http://localhost/samuraisec1.0/xadmin/mod/main-objective/x-main-objective.inc.php','{\"pageTitle\":\"Main Objective\",\"pageContent\":\"<p>To carry on business as underwriters, depository participant, distribution agents and brokers and to act as advisors for investment in and purchase, sale, subscription, acquisition or dealing in shares, units, negotiable instruments, obligations, derivatives, futures and options, mortgages and securities of any kind and in preparations of reports on technical feasibility and technical viability of project and other financial and investment matters and decisions and subject to such statutory permissions of SEBI or any other appropriate authorities as may be required and to become broker, sub-broker of any recognized stock exchange or any financial intermediary\\/ service provider.<\\/p>\\r\\n\",\"synopsis\":\"\",\"templateFile\":\"\",\"metaTitle\":\"\",\"metaKeyword\":\"\",\"metaDesc\":\"\",\"xAction\":\"UPDATE\",\"modName\":\"main-objective\",\"pageType\":\"edit\",\"langCode\":\"en\",\"pageID\":\"12\"}','2023-03-09 13:45:25',NULL),(720,'http://localhost/samuraisec1.0/xadmin/mod/our-aim/x-our-aim.inc.php','{\"pageTitle\":\"Our AIM\",\"pageContent\":\"<div class=\\\"col-2\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"title\\\">\\r\\n<h2><\\/h2>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n\\r\\n<div class=\\\"row\\\">\\r\\n<p>Our primary AIM is to maximize long-term stockholder value, while adhering to the laws of the jurisdictions in which it operates and at all times observing the highest ethical standards.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>To supply outstanding service and solutions through dedication and excellence.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>As a company, and as individuals, we value integrity, honesty, openness, personal excellence, constructive self-criticism, continual self-improvement, and mutual respect. We are committed to our customers and partners and have a passion for technology. We take on big challenges, and pride ourselves on seeing them through. We hold ourselves accountable to our customers, shareholders, partners, and employees by honoring our commitments, providing results, and striving for the highest quality.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n\",\"synopsis\":\"\",\"OpageImage\":[\"aim.png\"],\"templateFile\":\"\",\"metaTitle\":\"\",\"metaKeyword\":\"\",\"metaDesc\":\"\",\"xAction\":\"UPDATE\",\"modName\":\"our-aim\",\"pageType\":\"edit\",\"langCode\":\"en\",\"pageID\":\"8\"}','2023-03-09 13:52:13',NULL),(721,'http://localhost/samuraisec1.0/xadmin/mod/our-aim/x-our-aim.inc.php','{\"pageTitle\":\"Our AIM\",\"pageContent\":\"<p>Our primary AIM is to maximize long-term stockholder value, while adhering to the laws of the jurisdictions in which it operates and at all times observing the highest ethical standards.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>To supply outstanding service and solutions through dedication and excellence.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>As a company, and as individuals, we value integrity, honesty, openness, personal excellence, constructive self-criticism, continual self-improvement, and mutual respect. We are committed to our customers and partners and have a passion for technology. We take on big challenges, and pride ourselves on seeing them through. We hold ourselves accountable to our customers, shareholders, partners, and employees by honoring our commitments, providing results, and striving for the highest quality.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"synopsis\":\"\",\"OpageImage\":[\"aim.png\"],\"templateFile\":\"\",\"metaTitle\":\"\",\"metaKeyword\":\"\",\"metaDesc\":\"\",\"xAction\":\"UPDATE\",\"modName\":\"our-aim\",\"pageType\":\"edit\",\"langCode\":\"en\",\"pageID\":\"8\"}','2023-03-09 13:52:59',NULL),(722,'http://localhost/samuraisec1.0/xadmin/core-admin/mod/admin-menu/x-admin-menu.inc.php','{\"xAction\":\"recreateAdminMenu\"}','2023-03-09 14:02:19',NULL),(723,'http://localhost/samuraisec1.0/xadmin/core-admin/mod/admin-menu/x-admin-menu.inc.php','{\"xAction\":\"recreateAdminMenu\"}','2023-03-09 14:04:39',NULL),(724,'http://localhost/samuraisec1.0/xadmin/core-admin/mod/admin-menu/x-admin-menu.inc.php','{\"xAction\":\"recreateAdminMenu\"}','2023-03-09 15:07:56',NULL),(725,'http://localhost/samuraisec1.0/xadmin/core-admin/mod/admin-menu/x-admin-menu.inc.php','{\"parentID\":\"18\",\"menuTitle\":\"Our vision text\",\"xOrder\":\"0\",\"params\":\"?id=9&h=1\",\"forceNav\":\"edit\",\"xAction\":\"UPDATE\",\"modName\":\"admin-menu\",\"pageType\":\"edit\",\"langCode\":\"en\",\"adminMenuID\":\"28\"}','2023-03-09 15:10:24',NULL),(726,'http://localhost/samuraisec1.0/xadmin/mod/our-vision-text/x-our-vision-text.inc.php','{\"pageTitle\":\"Our Vision\",\"pageContent\":\"<p>Our vision serves as the framework for our Roadmap and guides every aspect of our business by describing what we need to accomplish in order to continue achieving sustainable, quality growth.<\\/p>\\r\\n\",\"synopsis\":\"<ul class=\\\"row col-4\\\">\\r\\n\\t<li>\\r\\n\\t<div class=\\\"card\\\">\\r\\n\\t<h4>People<\\/h4>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\t<p>Be a great place to work where people are inspired to be the best they can be.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\",\"templateFile\":\"\",\"metaTitle\":\"\",\"metaKeyword\":\"\",\"metaDesc\":\"\",\"xAction\":\"UPDATE\",\"modName\":\"our-vision-text\",\"pageType\":\"edit\",\"langCode\":\"en\",\"pageID\":\"9\"}','2023-03-09 15:21:41',NULL),(727,'http://localhost/